1
00:00:03,585 --> 00:02:03,585
Please contact turkision@gmail.com for any inquiries

2
00:02:04,185 --> 00:02:07,685
No living being was harmed
during the filming of this series.

3
00:02:08,785 --> 00:02:11,815
Episode 109

4
00:02:12,240 --> 00:02:13,770
Attack!

5
00:03:43,485 --> 00:03:46,045
After killing you...

6
00:03:46,685 --> 00:03:48,955
Your land will be under our rule.

7
00:03:51,965 --> 00:03:57,805
I will attack your country
like a black cloud.

8
00:03:58,095 --> 00:04:00,825
I break your hand if you dare.

9
00:04:08,735 --> 00:04:11,985
The noose will be wrapped
around your neck.

10
00:04:17,945 --> 00:04:21,035
Even if the rope is around
my neck, I'm a wolf.

11
00:04:21,675 --> 00:04:26,255
But, you are coyotes even
when you howl.

12
00:04:31,505 --> 00:04:33,545
When I get up...

13
00:04:34,775 --> 00:04:37,495
Then I will hold
you all accountable.

14
00:05:11,095 --> 00:05:12,595
Salam Alaikum.

15
00:05:13,165 --> 00:05:14,745
Alaikum Salam.

16
00:05:16,075 --> 00:05:19,285
The son of Osman Bey.

17
00:05:19,695 --> 00:05:21,715
Shahzad Aladdin.

18
00:05:24,635 --> 00:05:27,595
He desires to appear before the
presence of Sultan Aladdin...

19
00:05:27,705 --> 00:05:30,255
and talk to him about an important topic.

20
00:05:30,975 --> 00:05:34,275
Since when do you enter the palace
without permission, Dursun Fakı?

21
00:05:34,655 --> 00:05:38,245
Did you forget to ask permission when
you moved from Konya to the border?

22
00:05:44,705 --> 00:05:48,795
Take no offense at me, Aladdin Bey, but
a sultanate isn't the same as a sovereign.

23
00:05:53,465 --> 00:05:57,485
And the size of our
palace is evidence of this.

24
00:05:57,835 --> 00:06:01,385
I hope you are not
embarrassed by this greatness.

25
00:06:04,015 --> 00:06:06,805
You can go big if you're free, Vizier.

26
00:06:09,505 --> 00:06:12,305
In our palace, the enemy does
not move as he pleases.

27
00:06:13,215 --> 00:06:15,225
We want to host you there.

28
00:06:16,075 --> 00:06:19,105
You should get out of
our way for now.

29
00:06:19,725 --> 00:06:21,315
It's important.

30
00:06:27,775 --> 00:06:29,325
Guards.

31
00:06:34,225 --> 00:06:35,735
Open the doors.

32
00:06:55,845 --> 00:06:57,615
Give us a minute.

33
00:07:02,485 --> 00:07:05,025
Osman Bey.

34
00:07:06,955 --> 00:07:08,965
Look at you.

35
00:07:12,485 --> 00:07:17,485
The world turns around and
this day comes.

36
00:07:17,875 --> 00:07:25,625
You will be defeated by Bayındır, the
one you despised and underestimated.

37
00:07:26,745 --> 00:07:29,445
Bey of the Beys.

38
00:07:35,265 --> 00:07:37,275
Rule of coyotes...

39
00:07:42,195 --> 00:07:44,935
it continues until the
wolves are back on their feet

40
00:08:01,165 --> 00:08:03,675
Don't resist Osman, you will die.

41
00:08:03,755 --> 00:08:06,055
He will live!

42
00:08:06,185 --> 00:08:08,465
Don't you try to take my prey
out of my hands, Bayındır.

43
00:08:13,455 --> 00:08:16,305
I protect your head
from the Sultan Mother.

44
00:08:16,405 --> 00:08:17,705
The orders are certain.

45
00:08:17,775 --> 00:08:20,225
- Why?
- The tribes trust Osman.

46
00:08:20,380 --> 00:08:23,280
If we kill him now, they will consider
us their enemies.

47
00:08:23,385 --> 00:08:25,455
We'll spread the
news of his betrayal first

48
00:08:25,575 --> 00:08:28,065
Then we'll kill him!
Stop your men!

49
00:08:28,385 --> 00:08:32,895
Whoever withdraws the prey from the
front of the hyenas loses his arm.

50
00:08:33,205 --> 00:08:35,455
This is the last time, Bayındır.

51
00:08:36,345 --> 00:08:37,784
Catch him!

52
00:08:37,945 --> 00:08:39,695
Catch him alive!

53
00:08:42,025 --> 00:08:43,794
Brothers! Our Bey is there!

54
00:08:43,804 --> 00:08:45,115
Let's go!

55
00:08:45,675 --> 00:08:47,205
We're here, my Bey!

56
00:09:04,925 --> 00:09:08,985
You come as a guest and you want to be the
owner of the house, right, Mother Sultan?

57
00:09:09,115 --> 00:09:11,065
No!

58
00:09:11,245 --> 00:09:13,575
I will not allow you to lay eyes
on my Bey's trust.

59
00:09:13,665 --> 00:09:15,205
Keep calm, Bala!

60
00:09:15,295 --> 00:09:17,275
- Let me go, Malhun.
- You're making things difficult.

61
00:09:17,325 --> 00:09:18,645
Didn't you hear
what she said?

62
00:09:18,655 --> 00:09:20,325
- Not now.
- Now! Go away!

63
00:09:20,455 --> 00:09:21,755
Bala.

64
00:09:22,025 --> 00:09:23,595
Go away, Malhun.

65
00:09:23,595 --> 00:09:25,295
Arrest these
shameless people!

66
00:09:25,385 --> 00:09:26,705
Alps!

67
00:09:26,775 --> 00:09:28,565
- Get out of front of me.
- Not now!

68
00:09:28,595 --> 00:09:29,955
Now!

69
00:09:35,325 --> 00:09:37,625
Bala Hatun, what are you doing?

70
00:09:37,655 --> 00:09:39,235
The one standing in front of you is
the Sultan Mother.

71
00:09:39,275 --> 00:09:41,095
If she's Sultan Mother....

72
00:09:41,155 --> 00:09:44,655
This is the palace of Osman
Bey, and I am his wife!

73
00:09:51,165 --> 00:09:54,435
We do not hand over the trust to
anyone, no matter what.

74
00:09:54,995 --> 00:09:59,065
We do not hesitate to die
and kill for the sake of this.

75
00:10:05,735 --> 00:10:07,265
Soldiers!

76
00:10:45,715 --> 00:10:47,015
My Bey

77
00:10:53,385 --> 00:10:56,025
Order me to behead them all, my Sultan.

78
00:11:03,555 --> 00:11:06,335
Save your own head first.

79
00:11:14,685 --> 00:11:16,805
- Bala.
- Stop.

80
00:11:26,685 --> 00:11:28,195
Put down your swords.

81
00:11:34,485 --> 00:11:36,045
Alps.

82
00:11:55,785 --> 00:11:57,305
Mashallah.

83
00:12:00,025 --> 00:12:01,535
Mashallah.

84
00:12:02,915 --> 00:12:07,755
I know the source of
Osman Bey's power now.

85
00:12:12,585 --> 00:12:14,125
Bala Hatun.

86
00:12:14,915 --> 00:12:19,125
If only you had heard my
words silently and sat down...

87
00:12:20,355 --> 00:12:22,515
I would have been very disappointed.

88
00:12:22,935 --> 00:12:25,315
What are you trying to say, Sultan Mother?

89
00:12:26,035 --> 00:12:30,245
Let's say I wanted to know
who had the most courage.

90
00:12:36,995 --> 00:12:38,635
I've seen what I want to see.

91
00:12:43,095 --> 00:12:44,445
I'm very pleased.

92
00:12:48,195 --> 00:12:50,945
Look well, Sultan Mother.

93
00:12:52,355 --> 00:12:54,205
Be careful what you see is wrong.

94
00:12:54,305 --> 00:12:56,105
My eyes are never wrong...

95
00:12:56,175 --> 00:12:57,955
Malhun Hatun.

96
00:13:01,165 --> 00:13:04,895
Please, visit me soon, Bala Hatun.

97
00:13:07,175 --> 00:13:09,525
I want to know you more closely.

98
00:13:39,885 --> 00:13:41,205
Osman.

99
00:13:41,285 --> 00:13:44,365
You stand helpless like a
deer caught in a trap.

100
00:13:45,055 --> 00:13:49,585
If the deer knows the mountain, you
become the prey, not the hunter.

101
00:13:50,035 --> 00:13:52,835
You shouldn't have entered
this palace of mine.

102
00:13:53,435 --> 00:13:55,175
How will you get out now?

103
00:13:55,235 --> 00:13:57,775
We are here so that this place won't
become yours.

104
00:13:58,605 --> 00:14:00,415
And we know how to take it.

105
00:14:00,735 --> 00:14:02,295
Catch!

106
00:14:05,555 --> 00:14:07,605
You know what you're going to do, come on.

107
00:14:36,295 --> 00:14:37,805
Boran Alp.

108
00:14:38,895 --> 00:14:40,595
It is a matter of state.

109
00:14:41,095 --> 00:14:43,475
Stop so that no blood is spilled.

110
00:14:43,725 --> 00:14:47,215
A body that has this soul does
not stop, Bayındır Bey.

111
00:14:47,635 --> 00:14:49,205
While you have this mindset...

112
00:14:49,645 --> 00:14:51,915
Your soul will not stay in
your body for long.

113
00:15:39,775 --> 00:15:41,565
Surrender, Osman.

114
00:15:42,145 --> 00:15:46,335
Surrender so I will let you
breathe another night.

115
00:15:46,745 --> 00:15:49,505
Actually, I'm not going
to let you breathe.

116
00:15:50,215 --> 00:15:51,735
Mongolian soldier.

117
00:15:51,825 --> 00:15:54,715
I am the great leader Samagar!

118
00:15:55,215 --> 00:15:57,785
Soldier is a word for those
under my command.

119
00:15:58,485 --> 00:15:59,875
Mongolian soldier.

120
00:15:59,965 --> 00:16:02,485
Soldier, come on, take his sword!

121
00:16:30,485 --> 00:16:32,045
Osman Bey.

122
00:16:32,365 --> 00:16:35,375
Everything that happens to
you is because of your madness.

123
00:16:37,825 --> 00:16:39,345
Bayındır Bey.

124
00:16:39,525 --> 00:16:42,545
This madness runs in
the blood of all of us.

125
00:16:43,045 --> 00:16:46,045
Which will make me slash your throat.

126
00:16:46,145 --> 00:16:48,715
I ask fo Allah's forgiveness.

127
00:16:49,015 --> 00:16:50,925
Come on, take them to the dungeon.

128
00:16:50,945 --> 00:16:52,145
Stop.

129
00:16:52,955 --> 00:16:54,695
Those to the yard!

130
00:16:55,425 --> 00:16:59,765
I have good ideas for
Osman and his Alps.

131
00:17:01,785 --> 00:17:03,495
Take them, come on.

132
00:17:06,750 --> 00:17:08,345
My Bey.

133
00:17:08,665 --> 00:17:11,983
- My Bey.
- Come on!

134
00:17:20,750 --> 00:17:23,280
These have overstepped their bounds, my Sultan.

135
00:17:23,609 --> 00:17:25,140
They remain unpunished...

136
00:17:25,150 --> 00:17:28,220
Who told you they would go
unpunished, Bengi Hatun?

137
00:17:32,360 --> 00:17:36,090
Is it possible not to hold them
accountable for what they did?

138
00:17:37,210 --> 00:17:39,210
The time will come for all this.

139
00:17:44,180 --> 00:17:46,560
We no longer have
the strength to bear it.

140
00:17:51,520 --> 00:17:54,320
This happens because Osman Bey is not
there. Let's go to the palace quickly!

141
00:17:54,620 --> 00:17:57,570
Come on!

142
00:17:59,340 --> 00:18:01,720
The merchants have received
the word, My Sultan.

143
00:18:01,950 --> 00:18:04,830
Malhun Hatun should
think about it now.

144
00:18:05,680 --> 00:18:07,750
What is going on, my Sultan?

145
00:18:07,840 --> 00:18:10,700
They are market traders, why do
they meet?

146
00:18:12,100 --> 00:18:15,240
You were saying they'd
get away with it, Bengi Hatun.

147
00:18:18,990 --> 00:18:23,160
I have punished them with
the greatest punishment.

148
00:18:28,330 --> 00:18:32,580
You were saying that you would
speak before the Sultan.

149
00:18:33,350 --> 00:18:36,200
Tell me why you came.

150
00:18:40,060 --> 00:18:44,650
We came to warn the Sultan
of a trap set for him.

151
00:18:47,170 --> 00:18:50,360
Excuse me, my Sultan but...

152
00:18:50,800 --> 00:18:57,020
Who can tell us about something
that we cannot see?

153
00:18:57,760 --> 00:19:02,060
Are you participating in this trap and
making all this noise to prove otherwise?

154
00:19:03,070 --> 00:19:04,640
Hadrat Vizier.

155
00:19:04,880 --> 00:19:07,340
Weigh your words first, then speak!

156
00:19:07,950 --> 00:19:13,770
Aladdin Bey, son of Osman Bey...

157
00:19:14,050 --> 00:19:17,670
is telling you about it.

158
00:19:18,810 --> 00:19:21,480
Look at you, Dursun Fakı.

159
00:19:21,560 --> 00:19:25,120
Do you compare
yourself to the Vizierr?

160
00:19:25,570 --> 00:19:27,100
Vizier...

161
00:19:28,190 --> 00:19:30,040
Allow us, to hear his words.

162
00:19:35,440 --> 00:19:38,750
Say, Aladdin Bey, who
set a trap for me?

163
00:19:39,520 --> 00:19:42,260
It's a big trap, Hadrat Sultan...

164
00:19:42,330 --> 00:19:44,370
I can only say it to you.

165
00:19:46,670 --> 00:19:49,190
We cannot know who is on whose side.

166
00:19:50,740 --> 00:19:52,810
There is no one I don't trust here.

167
00:19:53,080 --> 00:19:54,620
Say what you're going to say.

168
00:19:55,260 --> 00:19:56,800
Hadrat Sultan.

169
00:19:57,300 --> 00:19:59,580
You can trust whomever
you want.

170
00:20:00,130 --> 00:20:04,360
But while you're on this throne, you can't
trust even your blood ties.

171
00:20:04,600 --> 00:20:06,660
You know that.

172
00:20:10,880 --> 00:20:14,180
Sultan Aladdin is the nephew
of Sultan Mesut.

173
00:20:14,500 --> 00:20:17,000
Sultan Mesut was always by our side.

174
00:20:17,310 --> 00:20:21,400
He did everything he could
to keep the borders strong.

175
00:20:23,070 --> 00:20:25,650
But this did not please
the Ilkhanid state.

176
00:20:25,980 --> 00:20:28,290
For this reason, they
considered him an enemy...

177
00:20:28,310 --> 00:20:30,820
and they made Sultan
Aladdin ascend the throne.

178
00:20:31,300 --> 00:20:33,930
We will find Sultan Mesut
and make him ascend the throne.

179
00:20:33,950 --> 00:20:35,750
How are we going to do it, father?

180
00:20:37,710 --> 00:20:39,800
This task will be yours.

181
00:20:46,670 --> 00:20:48,220
Everyone get out.

182
00:20:49,520 --> 00:20:50,450
My Sultan

183
00:20:50,470 --> 00:20:53,510
If you make me repeat myself, this
will be the end of you.

184
00:21:04,700 --> 00:21:06,220
My Sultan.

185
00:21:06,730 --> 00:21:10,280
Which of your moves did the leader
of the Ilkhanid state encourage you?

186
00:21:10,950 --> 00:21:12,530
I got everyone out.

187
00:21:13,920 --> 00:21:19,930
If you want me to listen to you, tell
me without equivocation, Aladdin.

188
00:21:20,330 --> 00:21:23,590
Otherwise, I will leave the
decision to the Vizier.

189
00:21:24,120 --> 00:21:26,890
As you wish, Hadrat Sultan.

190
00:21:29,630 --> 00:21:31,900
They want to dethrone you.

191
00:21:34,670 --> 00:21:39,440
They want to depose you and put your
uncle Mesut back on the throne.

192
00:21:40,060 --> 00:21:41,440
Who?

193
00:21:42,020 --> 00:21:43,910
Who are these shameless people?

194
00:21:49,500 --> 00:21:52,200
I'll hold them accountable
for what they did.

195
00:21:54,530 --> 00:21:56,610
I will make them regret.

196
00:21:58,370 --> 00:21:59,930
Not just me.

197
00:21:59,950 --> 00:22:02,920
I will make them regret what they
did to you and your daughter.

198
00:22:03,020 --> 00:22:06,050
I eagerly await that day, Sultan Mother.

199
00:22:06,930 --> 00:22:09,320
You're not going to
wait long, Bengi Hatun.

200
00:22:11,470 --> 00:22:15,420
I will take the market from
them first and then the palace.

201
00:22:18,470 --> 00:22:19,630
My Sultan.

202
00:22:21,480 --> 00:22:23,240
There is no limit to your power.

203
00:22:24,550 --> 00:22:29,250
You can take what you want
now and easily.

204
00:22:30,110 --> 00:22:31,810
Why are you waiting?

205
00:22:31,940 --> 00:22:33,950
Instead of stopping the caravans...

206
00:22:34,300 --> 00:22:38,840
You can be the owner of the whole market
with one order from you.

207
00:22:43,400 --> 00:22:45,910
It's not the market, Marta.

208
00:22:48,100 --> 00:22:50,680
I want to hear them.

209
00:22:54,920 --> 00:22:56,740
Caravans will not come.

210
00:22:59,170 --> 00:23:03,430
When the market runs out
of goods, famine will begin.

211
00:23:05,340 --> 00:23:07,100
Who will they accuse?

212
00:23:07,620 --> 00:23:10,450
Of course, Malhun Hatun. She
is in charge of the trade.

213
00:23:15,400 --> 00:23:21,060
I'll bring the caravans that Malhun
Hatun and Bala Hatun couldn't.

214
00:23:24,830 --> 00:23:28,350
I am the one who will save the
people from poverty.

215
00:23:31,110 --> 00:23:35,750
And then their eyes will not see
Bala and Malhun.

216
00:23:37,720 --> 00:23:40,220
They will see your power.

217
00:23:43,220 --> 00:23:45,000
Bengi Hatun.

218
00:23:46,200 --> 00:23:48,760
I will give you the responsibility
of the market.

219
00:23:52,410 --> 00:23:56,920
I am sure you will do the job perfectly.

220
00:23:57,990 --> 00:24:01,140
I will do all I can to live up to your
expectations, my Sultan.

221
00:24:08,090 --> 00:24:09,680
Konur Alp.

222
00:24:11,670 --> 00:24:13,060
So?

223
00:24:13,860 --> 00:24:15,570
Did you like my game?

224
00:24:17,000 --> 00:24:19,250
You know the right thing, Sultan Mother.

225
00:24:26,210 --> 00:24:27,470
Of course.

226
00:24:30,720 --> 00:24:34,130
I always know what's right.

227
00:24:41,330 --> 00:24:42,870
Well, you...

228
00:24:47,190 --> 00:24:49,730
Do you know that you sent Osman to death?

229
00:25:03,680 --> 00:25:09,200
Your devotion to Osman has brought the
end of you and Osman.

230
00:25:11,390 --> 00:25:15,980
Your end will be like the
end of those before you.

231
00:25:16,740 --> 00:25:18,600
I'm behind my case.

232
00:25:19,360 --> 00:25:21,190
Whatever you intend to do...

233
00:25:21,400 --> 00:25:23,430
It will wrap around your feet.

234
00:25:24,540 --> 00:25:26,850
I will humiliate you first.

235
00:25:27,590 --> 00:25:29,410
Then I will destroy you.

236
00:25:29,900 --> 00:25:32,740
You will see it all in your life.

237
00:25:36,810 --> 00:25:38,580
Put him in the dungeon!

238
00:26:05,725 --> 00:26:08,025
Who are those who have their
sights set on my throne?

239
00:26:08,065 --> 00:26:10,605
They are the ones who
dethroned Mesut.

240
00:26:10,995 --> 00:26:14,555
I dethroned my uncle, he was blind.

241
00:26:14,955 --> 00:26:18,975
He especially neglected you and caused
our strength to weaken.

242
00:26:20,815 --> 00:26:25,335
You seem confident
and speak without measure.

243
00:26:29,135 --> 00:26:31,665
Let it be as the Sultan deems fit

244
00:26:32,365 --> 00:26:38,875
I asked everyone to get out, not so that I could speak comfortably, but so that you could speak comfortably.

245
00:26:39,065 --> 00:26:41,585
What will I hide in
my palace?

246
00:26:41,865 --> 00:26:47,185
Ilkhanid state lets you on the throne and its
ability to remove you from it when you wish.

247
00:26:52,035 --> 00:26:55,730
My father, Osman Bey, who
gave me your name...

248
00:26:55,730 --> 00:26:59,590
in order to become as important as you
and your ancestors, is in the palace.

249
00:26:59,885 --> 00:27:01,765
Is Osman Bey in the palace?

250
00:27:05,925 --> 00:27:08,625
He fights those who want to dethrone you.

251
00:27:09,135 --> 00:27:12,165
We came here as soon as we
heard this information.

252
00:27:12,735 --> 00:27:16,095
Your presence on the
throne is like kindness to us.

253
00:27:16,875 --> 00:27:20,355
We, as your followers, hope to
maintain this status.

254
00:27:24,305 --> 00:27:25,815
Osman Bey.

255
00:27:27,285 --> 00:27:30,155
I heard he has a strained
relationship with my mother.

256
00:27:30,845 --> 00:27:33,405
Will he come to
protect me though?

257
00:27:34,055 --> 00:27:38,915
You don't need to be protected.

258
00:27:39,775 --> 00:27:42,295
Everything we do is to serve you.

259
00:27:49,235 --> 00:27:51,085
Where is
Osman Bey?

260
00:27:54,605 --> 00:27:57,125
- Leave me.
- My Bey.

261
00:28:05,695 --> 00:28:07,525
My Bey!

262
00:28:09,405 --> 00:28:11,435
We'll chop off all of your heads.

263
00:28:11,695 --> 00:28:13,775
We'll chop off all of your heads.

264
00:28:13,845 --> 00:28:15,175
All!

265
00:28:15,185 --> 00:28:17,705
- My Bey!
- Leave me!

266
00:28:19,485 --> 00:28:25,575
Close all exits and entrances to the palace
and don't allow anyone to approach Sultan's residence.

267
00:28:37,315 --> 00:28:40,905
Don't resist, Osman!

268
00:28:49,875 --> 00:28:52,885
So, you're trying to
put me in this cage.

269
00:28:54,235 --> 00:28:57,945
I swear to you, I will make this
world a prison for you.

270
00:29:03,565 --> 00:29:05,635
Osman Bey.

271
00:29:07,225 --> 00:29:10,505
I was meant to see you in this position.

272
00:29:13,385 --> 00:29:14,935
Don't touch!

273
00:29:15,325 --> 00:29:19,215
Didn't you tell me to arrest these
people while they were alive?

274
00:29:20,075 --> 00:29:21,405
Here, they are alive.

275
00:29:22,575 --> 00:29:24,475
We'll have a little fun with them.

276
00:29:26,685 --> 00:29:28,185
And we will crush them.

277
00:29:36,615 --> 00:29:39,655
We will now crush Osman's heart.

278
00:29:40,005 --> 00:29:41,525
Soldiers!

279
00:29:44,365 --> 00:29:47,375
- Boran.
- Don't worry about us, My Bey.

280
00:29:48,025 --> 00:29:50,605
We cannot be hurt!

281
00:29:55,285 --> 00:29:57,345
- Come on.
- Come on, come on!

282
00:30:01,085 --> 00:30:02,625
Brothers!

283
00:30:08,485 --> 00:30:14,215
Attack Osman and his warriors as
you wish but don't kill them.

284
00:30:14,855 --> 00:30:17,925
So as not to be held accountable for that in
front of the Mother Sultan.

285
00:30:17,975 --> 00:30:20,995
No one can hold Samagar accountable.

286
00:30:21,775 --> 00:30:25,675
He can't have mercy on Osman,
especially after he fell into his hands.

287
00:30:34,885 --> 00:30:39,985
The Sultan Mother will do everything
she can to stop us and break us.

288
00:30:43,005 --> 00:30:45,275
So, we'll fight to the end, mother.

289
00:30:46,645 --> 00:30:49,765
All possibilities exist in this way.

290
00:30:50,125 --> 00:30:52,415
But we'll be careful first.

291
00:30:52,855 --> 00:30:57,435
- Will you let me in, Malhun Hatun?
- Come in, Cerkutay.

292
00:31:13,415 --> 00:31:15,125
What's going on outside, Cerkutay?

293
00:31:15,755 --> 00:31:19,385
Market traders are waiting
to enter the Court.

294
00:31:21,535 --> 00:31:23,535
Go ahead.

295
00:31:30,055 --> 00:31:31,565
Go ahead.

296
00:31:39,595 --> 00:31:41,885
Let everyone disclose their problems.

297
00:31:42,055 --> 00:31:45,445
Beys, this is Osman Bey's court.

298
00:31:45,805 --> 00:31:48,355
Get yourselves together first.

299
00:31:48,765 --> 00:31:51,425
The merchants and the people
are in a deplorable state.

300
00:31:51,565 --> 00:31:53,365
What are you saying? Speak clearly.

301
00:31:53,395 --> 00:31:58,625
Caravans no longer come to Yenişehir and
those who come from Constantinople don't come.

302
00:31:58,815 --> 00:32:01,195
And now, those who came
from Konya don't come too.

303
00:32:01,295 --> 00:32:03,895
If this continues, we will
not find bread to eat.

304
00:32:04,555 --> 00:32:09,085
Calm down, Beys!
We will not leave anyone hungry.

305
00:32:11,175 --> 00:32:17,765
I'll take care of the caravans myself and
will provide everything you need.

306
00:32:18,615 --> 00:32:21,505
Now go back to your shops and
wait for me to tell you.

307
00:32:22,075 --> 00:32:24,405
Do not incite others.

308
00:32:42,825 --> 00:32:44,595
Hang on, brothers!

309
00:32:53,665 --> 00:32:55,705
Hang on!

310
00:33:04,755 --> 00:33:06,295
Come on, brother.

311
00:33:39,505 --> 00:33:41,265
Alps!

312
00:33:45,085 --> 00:33:48,295
Oh, great leader Samagar, allow us
to crush Osman too

313
00:33:48,425 --> 00:33:51,745
I have other plans for Osman.

314
00:33:52,615 --> 00:33:56,155
We'll rip his heart out.

315
00:34:00,075 --> 00:34:01,865
Soldiers!

316
00:34:34,195 --> 00:34:35,565
Come on.

317
00:34:42,245 --> 00:34:46,275
If you want freedom, rise
and fight, Osman.

318
00:35:20,525 --> 00:35:21,935
Come and see.

319
00:36:23,935 --> 00:36:25,545
Attack!

320
00:36:26,215 --> 00:36:31,215
Attention, everyone!
Sultan Aladdin is coming.

321
00:36:49,895 --> 00:36:52,755
Our first target will be Sultan Mesut.

322
00:36:53,255 --> 00:37:00,715
But if not, say that the Mongols who hold
us are targeting Sultan Mesut.

323
00:37:02,515 --> 00:37:05,555
Their minds will be confused
by the ingenuity of your words.

324
00:37:07,725 --> 00:37:13,265
Thus, Sultan Aladdin will save
us from their hands.

325
00:37:14,895 --> 00:37:16,835
Your command, Osman Bey.

326
00:37:17,115 --> 00:37:18,715
Thank you.

327
00:37:19,225 --> 00:37:20,935
Allah bless you, my son.

328
00:37:28,125 --> 00:37:31,795
It is possible that Osman Bey has stopped
the traitors' moves.

329
00:37:31,945 --> 00:37:35,585
But he was captured by
Samagar and his soldiers.

330
00:37:35,985 --> 00:37:39,495
You told me that you should not trust
anyone while you are on the throne.

331
00:37:39,595 --> 00:37:41,455
I do not trust you.

332
00:37:43,535 --> 00:37:45,785
But I will listen to what
Osman Bey has to say.

333
00:37:45,855 --> 00:37:48,285
So, we have to move quickly, my Sultan.

334
00:37:48,395 --> 00:37:53,355
The Mongols will try to kill my father so
that their games will not be exposed.

335
00:37:56,435 --> 00:37:58,405
Let Samagar wait for me inside.

336
00:38:00,715 --> 00:38:02,925
Stop it!

337
00:38:14,615 --> 00:38:16,695
What's the matter, Osman Bey?

338
00:38:22,415 --> 00:38:24,535
The matter is, my Sultan...

339
00:38:25,635 --> 00:38:28,515
We should ask you
about the situation here.

340
00:38:30,985 --> 00:38:35,735
But we are in this place that
contains many enemies.

341
00:38:37,915 --> 00:38:40,035
We were not surprised by this sedition.

342
00:38:47,095 --> 00:38:49,655
You will tell me everything in detail.

343
00:38:51,035 --> 00:38:53,845
And you will be held
accountable for that, Osman Bey.

344
00:38:56,750 --> 00:38:58,800
If I fully believe your intention...

345
00:38:59,780 --> 00:39:03,110
Then I will forgive you as
you have forgiven now.

346
00:39:06,350 --> 00:39:08,230
Thank you, Sultan.

347
00:39:15,610 --> 00:39:18,130
See the wounds of Osman
Bey and his warriors.

348
00:39:21,160 --> 00:39:22,720
Clean them up.

349
00:39:23,980 --> 00:39:25,800
Then I want him in my presence.

350
00:39:28,230 --> 00:39:30,110
Your command, my Sultan.

351
00:39:35,100 --> 00:39:36,820
And...

352
00:39:37,160 --> 00:39:38,960
Aladdin Bey will be with me.

353
00:39:58,360 --> 00:40:00,930
Everything is going as we want, Osman Bey.

354
00:40:01,120 --> 00:40:04,450
They will reveal the whereabouts of
Sultan Mesut as soon as possible.

355
00:40:09,270 --> 00:40:11,170
You did well with Aladdin.

356
00:40:12,430 --> 00:40:14,000
I will take care of the rest.

357
00:40:14,180 --> 00:40:15,490
Okay.

358
00:40:15,620 --> 00:40:17,350
We'll get what we want.

359
00:40:17,570 --> 00:40:19,150
From now on...

360
00:40:19,850 --> 00:40:21,660
You will do your job.

361
00:40:22,600 --> 00:40:24,100
Your command, my Bey.

362
00:40:25,640 --> 00:40:27,190
Alps!

363
00:40:28,790 --> 00:40:30,680
You are fine, right?

364
00:40:34,370 --> 00:40:36,380
We've had better days
than these, my Bey.

365
00:40:37,810 --> 00:40:39,610
But we are alive, thank Allah.

366
00:40:40,220 --> 00:40:43,880
It's okay to take a break to
stay alive for the case.

367
00:40:46,140 --> 00:40:47,440
Come on.

368
00:40:50,490 --> 00:40:51,800
Hüseyin.

369
00:40:52,700 --> 00:40:55,120
Get ready quickly.

370
00:40:56,390 --> 00:40:58,730
Inform Mother Sultan of what is happening.

371
00:40:59,480 --> 00:41:00,810
Come on.

372
00:41:17,205 --> 00:41:19,245
How are the merchants, Ayşe?

373
00:41:20,665 --> 00:41:24,565
When caravans refuse to deliver new goods;
to Yenişehir, despite their promises...

374
00:41:24,935 --> 00:41:27,815
The trade has fewer commodities, Malhun.

375
00:41:30,955 --> 00:41:31,975
Mother.

376
00:41:32,445 --> 00:41:34,925
Mother Sultan don't
even care about the people...

377
00:41:35,175 --> 00:41:37,555
so that we will need her.

378
00:41:37,995 --> 00:41:39,765
She doesn't
send caravans.

379
00:41:39,785 --> 00:41:42,575
In case we don't secure the
resources for Yenişehir...

380
00:41:43,715 --> 00:41:46,455
The people will depend on her
as well as the Beys.

381
00:41:48,025 --> 00:41:49,385
We will be fine.

382
00:41:50,755 --> 00:41:52,325
Aktemur.

383
00:41:52,395 --> 00:41:55,045
Don't neglect the needs of the
merchants in the market.

384
00:41:55,175 --> 00:41:57,875
When resources
decrease, opportunists increase.

385
00:41:58,085 --> 00:42:00,335
We will not let anyone
open their eyes.

386
00:42:01,945 --> 00:42:04,955
Mother Sultan, the measures
have increased a lot.

387
00:42:06,375 --> 00:42:07,445
What do you intend?

388
00:42:09,605 --> 00:42:12,845
We will burn this world to those who
try to scare us with famine.

389
00:42:15,975 --> 00:42:17,855
Hear me well now.

390
00:42:21,905 --> 00:42:26,405
We'll secretly extract the resources in the
castles and tribes and bring them to Yenişehir.

391
00:42:29,035 --> 00:42:32,055
How will those resources be
enough for all the people, Malhun Hatun?

392
00:42:32,095 --> 00:42:35,635
Until the issue of the caravans is resolved,
it will suffice, of course, but...

393
00:42:35,665 --> 00:42:37,185
We have to hurry.

394
00:42:38,525 --> 00:42:39,875
Aktemur.

395
00:42:39,885 --> 00:42:42,625
Send Alps to castles and clans quickly.

396
00:42:46,075 --> 00:42:49,365
How are we going to accomplish
this with all these infidels, mother?

397
00:42:56,555 --> 00:42:58,085
Oh.

398
00:42:59,745 --> 00:43:01,595
And the goods, Bekir Bey?

399
00:43:02,245 --> 00:43:04,765
Were you able to collect
the goods in Yenişehir?

400
00:43:04,835 --> 00:43:07,945
We collected the goods, even those
in our shops, Sultan Mother.

401
00:43:08,615 --> 00:43:11,905
And we will buy the remaining commodities
in the possession of the merchants.

402
00:43:11,935 --> 00:43:15,105
No commodity will remain in
the market for sale and purchase.

403
00:43:17,475 --> 00:43:19,035
Good.

404
00:43:19,185 --> 00:43:22,385
What about the resources found in
neighboring tribes and castles?

405
00:43:22,775 --> 00:43:26,495
We've bought the resources from the tribes
for twice the price, Mother Sultan.

406
00:43:26,615 --> 00:43:29,615
As for the resources of the castles, Olof
and his men have taken them.

407
00:43:31,215 --> 00:43:32,955
Sultan Mother.

408
00:43:33,135 --> 00:43:35,345
Where are we going
to put all these resources?

409
00:43:35,735 --> 00:43:37,635
In the cave of our ally Olof.

410
00:43:40,545 --> 00:43:42,535
What are the
conditions of the people?

411
00:43:42,855 --> 00:43:44,925
How many resources
are there in the vaults?

412
00:43:45,125 --> 00:43:47,665
The people have been acting hasty
from now on, Sultan Mother.

413
00:43:47,785 --> 00:43:50,945
Thy will believe it if I say that the
famine will begin tomorrow.

414
00:43:53,215 --> 00:43:56,435
Malhun Hatun will remain helpless.

415
00:43:58,025 --> 00:44:00,545
She will remain so helpless that...

416
00:44:01,695 --> 00:44:05,065
She will deliver Yenişehir to
me with her own hands.

417
00:44:09,315 --> 00:44:11,085
Now, without wasting time...

418
00:44:11,175 --> 00:44:13,185
bring the resources to
Olof's cave.

419
00:44:13,645 --> 00:44:15,445
It's the safest place.

420
00:44:23,675 --> 00:44:25,725
And you send word to Bala Hatun.

421
00:44:26,255 --> 00:44:28,265
Tell her she will be our guest.

422
00:44:31,505 --> 00:44:33,005
She will come.

423
00:44:41,425 --> 00:44:44,525
Konya / Seljuqs Palace

424
00:44:48,650 --> 00:44:50,750
We did what we had to do.

425
00:44:52,550 --> 00:44:55,890
We knew their tricks
and fell into their trap.

426
00:44:56,670 --> 00:44:57,990
However...

427
00:44:58,530 --> 00:45:01,300
Now it's time for us
to play our game.

428
00:45:04,800 --> 00:45:08,640
I knew they would try to kill us without
even saying to Sultan Aladdin.

429
00:45:10,700 --> 00:45:12,240
So...

430
00:45:13,430 --> 00:45:15,270
Who moves so fast?

431
00:45:20,970 --> 00:45:22,700
Someone who keeps a secret.

432
00:45:26,020 --> 00:45:27,560
Mongols...

433
00:45:27,910 --> 00:45:32,470
They support Sultan Mesut to
remain a threat to Sultan Aladdin.

434
00:45:33,300 --> 00:45:34,490
For this reason...

435
00:45:35,910 --> 00:45:39,210
In the eyes of Sultan Aladdin, they're
more suspect than we are.

436
00:45:41,400 --> 00:45:44,300
I created my game with my son Aladdin.

437
00:45:45,970 --> 00:45:48,230
The power of the
Ilkhanid state in Konya...

438
00:45:49,500 --> 00:45:51,500
We weakened it in the
eyes of Sultan Aladdin.

439
00:45:52,440 --> 00:45:54,830
Samagar can't do
as he pleases.

440
00:45:56,860 --> 00:45:59,080
Every throne sheds
blood from below.

441
00:46:02,220 --> 00:46:03,940
We'll exploit their greed...

442
00:46:04,510 --> 00:46:06,280
We'll get what we want.

443
00:46:08,330 --> 00:46:09,920
With the power of the east...

444
00:46:10,700 --> 00:46:12,750
We will open the
gates of the West.

445
00:46:13,770 --> 00:46:15,490
Inshallah, my Bey.

446
00:46:18,280 --> 00:46:19,820
Let's go now.

447
00:46:20,820 --> 00:46:22,700
Let's do the last move in our game.

448
00:46:24,740 --> 00:46:26,040
Come on.

449
00:46:34,340 --> 00:46:36,610
I will find whoever is
behind this betrayal

450
00:46:36,670 --> 00:46:40,540
And I will hang his head at the entrance
to Konya, to be an example to the world.

451
00:46:40,590 --> 00:46:42,090
Everyone should know.

452
00:46:47,710 --> 00:46:50,220
My Sultan, excuse me but...

453
00:46:51,990 --> 00:46:53,340
I believe that...

454
00:46:54,370 --> 00:46:56,970
who comes and disturbs the peace...

455
00:46:57,400 --> 00:46:58,960
is guilty.

456
00:46:59,000 --> 00:47:00,530
My Sultan.

457
00:47:00,610 --> 00:47:02,350
Excuse me but...

458
00:47:02,400 --> 00:47:05,070
Whoever finds sedition and
uproots it from its roots...

459
00:47:05,250 --> 00:47:07,810
he will disturb the peace
of the owner of sedition.

460
00:47:20,130 --> 00:47:22,920
Protector of all tribes around.

461
00:47:23,770 --> 00:47:26,150
He who made the property
of the infidels his home.

462
00:47:26,930 --> 00:47:28,460
Commander of the conquerors.

463
00:47:28,720 --> 00:47:30,240
Osman Bey.

464
00:47:52,880 --> 00:47:54,470
My Sultan.

465
00:47:56,440 --> 00:47:58,480
May peace and respect be upon you.

466
00:47:58,860 --> 00:48:01,390
The way you came has
never been so kind.

467
00:48:03,900 --> 00:48:06,360
Either you prevented
sedition from occurring...

468
00:48:06,720 --> 00:48:08,750
Or you wanted to cause mess.

469
00:48:09,690 --> 00:48:12,720
We'll know the truth from
what we will hear from you now.

470
00:48:13,750 --> 00:48:17,780
Thank you for listening me.

471
00:48:22,140 --> 00:48:23,520
Hadrat Sultan.

472
00:48:24,840 --> 00:48:25,840
For years...

473
00:48:27,110 --> 00:48:29,780
The Kayı tribe and Konya have been
united.

474
00:48:31,010 --> 00:48:33,720
It was like this during the reign
of your uncle, Sultan Mesut.

475
00:48:36,100 --> 00:48:38,640
Inshallah, it will be so now.

476
00:48:39,260 --> 00:48:41,790
Will you achieve unity with
these words, Osman Bey?

477
00:48:41,990 --> 00:48:44,970
By repeating the name of the old sultan in front of the new sultan?

478
00:48:49,310 --> 00:48:50,780
Your tongue has no limit.

479
00:48:52,290 --> 00:48:53,990
And its consequences can be severe.

480
00:48:59,540 --> 00:49:02,060
Unlimited tongues speak the truth.

481
00:49:04,650 --> 00:49:08,250
You said you wanted to
hear the truth from me.

482
00:49:10,250 --> 00:49:11,460
But it is clear that...

483
00:49:13,710 --> 00:49:15,870
Some of the sycophants you have...

484
00:49:17,460 --> 00:49:20,220
They comfort you with
lies that you admire.

485
00:49:23,810 --> 00:49:25,460
Even the throne you sit on...

486
00:49:28,680 --> 00:49:32,210
is strong enough to be unshakable in
the name of a deposed Sultan.

487
00:49:35,160 --> 00:49:36,730
it is obvious that...

488
00:49:37,490 --> 00:49:39,550
Some would like it to be.

489
00:49:42,960 --> 00:49:44,530
Samagar.

490
00:49:46,870 --> 00:49:50,680
Didn't Ghazan Khan send
his son to be your guard?

491
00:49:55,080 --> 00:49:56,640
So that...

492
00:49:57,610 --> 00:49:59,690
Sultan Mesut of the ruling dynasty...

493
00:50:00,290 --> 00:50:02,880
didn't they threaten him to
ascend the throne?

494
00:50:07,160 --> 00:50:09,710
Sultan.

495
00:50:10,670 --> 00:50:12,780
I am the shadow of Ghazan Khan.

496
00:50:13,160 --> 00:50:14,970
Representative of
the Ilkhanid state.

497
00:50:15,230 --> 00:50:19,820
But if you will judge me with the
words of a Bey of the tribe...

498
00:50:20,660 --> 00:50:22,550
All Konya will pay for this.

499
00:50:22,890 --> 00:50:24,460
Disrespectful!

500
00:50:26,390 --> 00:50:28,170
How dare you talk like that?

501
00:50:28,790 --> 00:50:31,180
We are the ones who put
you on that throne.

502
00:50:31,240 --> 00:50:34,860
If you speak again, I will cut out your
tongue and send it to Ghazan Khan.

503
00:50:41,940 --> 00:50:43,470
Soldier.

504
00:50:45,910 --> 00:50:47,940
If you didn't have a move to hide...

505
00:50:48,440 --> 00:50:50,860
You would have brought us
and handed us over to the Sultan.

506
00:50:54,210 --> 00:50:56,110
If our heads were to be cut off...

507
00:50:56,490 --> 00:50:57,760
then it would be cut off.

508
00:51:00,150 --> 00:51:02,160
But you hid
your move.

509
00:51:03,570 --> 00:51:05,150
Even when you were hiding...

510
00:51:06,250 --> 00:51:08,810
you threw the Seljuqs
banner on the ground.

511
00:51:11,360 --> 00:51:13,210
Put the leader in the
dungeon.

512
00:51:14,120 --> 00:51:16,160
I will interrogate him in private.

513
00:51:17,440 --> 00:51:18,940
Osman.

514
00:51:30,415 --> 00:51:32,495
As long as the Mongols
are in the palace...

515
00:51:35,135 --> 00:51:36,985
Our enemies will not end, Sultan.

516
00:51:39,775 --> 00:51:45,845
Even the devil acts cautious.

517
00:51:48,825 --> 00:51:50,325
Bayındır Bey.

518
00:51:51,065 --> 00:51:53,085
What do you think
about this?

519
00:51:58,975 --> 00:52:00,975
I'm asking you, Bayındır Bey.

520
00:52:01,975 --> 00:52:03,475
My Sultan.

521
00:52:03,895 --> 00:52:06,485
You are known for your
devotion to the Sultan Mother.

522
00:52:07,455 --> 00:52:09,195
Why did you come here?

523
00:52:10,015 --> 00:52:13,895
Will you stop Osman Bey
to take the throne from me?

524
00:52:15,695 --> 00:52:17,395
Or will you help me?

525
00:52:23,095 --> 00:52:24,965
They've kidnapped Alçiçek.

526
00:52:29,095 --> 00:52:31,945
Alçiçek and Aktemur's wedding is
taking place tomorrow.

527
00:52:40,745 --> 00:52:42,245
Bayındır Bey.

528
00:52:42,445 --> 00:52:45,965
This is your share of the spoils we took
from the conquest of Marmaracık.

529
00:52:47,165 --> 00:52:49,755
This sword is a gift from me to you.

530
00:52:50,985 --> 00:52:52,485
May Allah bless you

531
00:52:59,175 --> 00:53:00,895
May Allah bless you, my Bey.

532
00:53:04,965 --> 00:53:06,535
My Sultan.

533
00:53:09,325 --> 00:53:18,105
Mother Sultan has defeated
Osman Bey several times.

534
00:53:19,655 --> 00:53:21,715
Osman Bey is a keen and ambitious man.

535
00:53:22,595 --> 00:53:29,185
I can't tell if he got
involved in such a case or not...

536
00:53:32,185 --> 00:53:33,725
but...

537
00:53:35,345 --> 00:53:38,855
it's known how Mongols see this matter.

538
00:53:40,285 --> 00:53:42,085
Is Osman Bey wrong?

539
00:53:42,125 --> 00:53:44,685
May the Mongols not
always take advantage of this?

540
00:53:45,295 --> 00:53:46,595
Now...

541
00:53:47,185 --> 00:53:50,255
Will you trust the
leader of the Ilkhanid state?

542
00:53:52,315 --> 00:53:54,105
Or a Turkish Bey?

543
00:53:56,435 --> 00:54:00,975
It's up to you, my Sultan.

544
00:54:16,855 --> 00:54:18,895
I will spare your life, Osman Bey.

545
00:54:22,785 --> 00:54:24,285
On one condition.

546
00:54:27,765 --> 00:54:29,575
Your son Aladdin...

547
00:54:34,115 --> 00:54:38,855
will be my guest
until the truth comes out.

548
00:54:51,575 --> 00:54:52,875
Okay.

549
00:54:54,415 --> 00:54:56,115
Okay, my Sultan.

550
00:54:59,455 --> 00:55:05,455
I will not fear for my son
because I am sure of my innocence.

551
00:55:07,615 --> 00:55:09,375
However you want.

552
00:55:10,385 --> 00:55:12,235
Come with Aladdin Bey.

553
00:55:26,895 --> 00:55:32,605
Beys can go away if
there is nothing else to say.

554
00:55:45,935 --> 00:55:47,635
My Sultan.

555
00:56:03,295 --> 00:56:04,795
Speak up, Saveli.

556
00:56:05,645 --> 00:56:07,145
My Sultan.

557
00:56:08,575 --> 00:56:12,785
Osman Bey even interfered in the matter
of the throne in Constantinople.

558
00:56:13,215 --> 00:56:15,795
Weakening the states around
was one of his plans.

559
00:56:16,535 --> 00:56:18,235
We should not trust him.

560
00:56:18,485 --> 00:56:19,985
Vizier.

561
00:56:22,115 --> 00:56:23,975
I have no doubt.

562
00:56:25,625 --> 00:56:27,425
You don't see the main issue.

563
00:56:29,175 --> 00:56:30,975
The case is not Osman...

564
00:56:31,745 --> 00:56:33,245
or Samagar.

565
00:56:35,075 --> 00:56:36,915
The issue is my Uncle Mesut.

566
00:56:44,205 --> 00:56:45,905
Yenişehir

567
00:56:46,985 --> 00:56:50,515
The Tribes are out of
supplies, Malhun Hatun.

568
00:56:51,125 --> 00:56:55,715
Resources have been looted in and
around the castles by Olof's men.

569
00:56:56,585 --> 00:56:59,475
Not even one place left to buy
supplies, Malhun Hatun.

570
00:57:00,940 --> 00:57:02,750
They are taking precautions.

571
00:57:04,530 --> 00:57:06,870
What did they do with
those supplies, Kumral Abdul?

572
00:57:07,000 --> 00:57:09,080
They took them away.

573
00:57:09,180 --> 00:57:12,010
No one knows where.

574
00:57:15,040 --> 00:57:17,120
What they could not
do with the sword...

575
00:57:17,890 --> 00:57:20,200
They want to do it by trading.

576
00:57:21,890 --> 00:57:24,820
If we don't find those supplies, it's
going to be bad for us, mother.

577
00:57:24,880 --> 00:57:28,160
They will terrorize the people with famine
and turn them against us.

578
00:57:32,010 --> 00:57:34,070
We will open Yenişehir's warehouse.

579
00:57:34,510 --> 00:57:35,860
Aktemur.

580
00:57:36,020 --> 00:57:39,410
Give people who are in difficult condition
the foods in the warehouse.

581
00:57:39,550 --> 00:57:42,840
We'll take care of every need, house
by house Malhun Hatun, but...

582
00:57:44,430 --> 00:57:46,980
There are not many
supplies in the warehouse.

583
00:57:53,350 --> 00:57:55,940
Where are they taking
all those supplies?

584
00:57:56,460 --> 00:57:59,050
It must be a place on the
way of castles and tribes.

585
00:58:00,010 --> 00:58:05,260
They know we'll raid and take them
if we know where they are.

586
00:58:06,670 --> 00:58:08,240
It must be a deserted place.

587
00:58:10,620 --> 00:58:12,590
Especially the caves.

588
00:58:14,500 --> 00:58:23,760
There are dozens of caves near the castles
of Karacahisar, Kulucahisar and Bilecik.

589
00:58:24,350 --> 00:58:26,710
This place is such a place that...

590
00:58:27,470 --> 00:58:30,540
the units can recognize
in the event of a raid.

591
00:58:30,540 --> 00:58:35,740
The caves of Taşkaya, Beytepe and Yaslıtaş
are on the way to these castles.

592
00:58:36,270 --> 00:58:40,380
And it's close to Köprühisar
at the same time.

593
00:58:41,660 --> 00:58:44,750
Your order has come
to Konya, my Sultan.

594
00:59:04,750 --> 00:59:08,270
Bala Hatun, welcome.

595
00:59:09,750 --> 00:59:12,780
You said it's
an important subject, Sultan Mother.

596
00:59:13,470 --> 00:59:14,780
Here I am.

597
00:59:16,460 --> 00:59:19,010
No matter how inappropriate
events we have experienced...

598
00:59:19,890 --> 00:59:21,380
They are all left behind.

599
00:59:21,980 --> 00:59:25,940
You invited me to your
table, now it's my turn.

600
00:59:27,430 --> 00:59:29,210
Sit at my table first.

601
00:59:43,410 --> 00:59:45,110
Do not worry.

602
00:59:45,950 --> 00:59:50,340
We know how to respect food and
how to act as a guest.

603
00:59:50,340 --> 00:59:51,950
No problem.

604
00:59:53,650 --> 00:59:55,100
Bala Hatun.

605
00:59:58,410 --> 01:00:02,660
First, I want you to know that I
appreciate you very much.

606
01:00:03,350 --> 01:00:08,490
I heard about the role of The Sisters
in the conquests. This is your skill.

607
01:00:09,820 --> 01:00:12,650
Thank you, Sultan Mother.

608
01:00:13,030 --> 01:00:16,670
Right, our female warriors
are very skilled.

609
01:00:17,170 --> 01:00:21,110
They do not give safety to the
unbelievers or the heathens.

610
01:00:21,190 --> 01:00:24,170
Mashallah.

611
01:00:25,090 --> 01:00:30,910
But I think you missed something while
you were running from war to war.

612
01:00:32,980 --> 01:00:34,050
The palace.

613
01:00:36,050 --> 01:00:39,930
You must never withdraw your hand
from the works of palace, Bala Hatun.

614
01:00:41,700 --> 01:00:44,020
Otherwise, no one will know its limit.

615
01:00:44,970 --> 01:00:48,650
Pay no attention to these
things, Sultan Mother.

616
01:00:49,090 --> 01:00:51,100
We don't have throne case.

617
01:00:51,580 --> 01:00:53,220
My Osman Bey commands...

618
01:00:53,220 --> 01:00:56,840
and we do what should be done.

619
01:00:56,910 --> 01:00:58,910
Everyone knows their mission.

620
01:01:01,610 --> 01:01:07,810
I can't quite believe this after
what I've witnessed, Bala Hatun.

621
01:01:09,020 --> 01:01:11,150
What do you mean, Sultan Mother?

622
01:01:13,150 --> 01:01:17,590
What annoyed me more than your
dagger pointing at me in the palace is...

623
01:01:17,590 --> 01:01:21,550
Malhun Hatun's attempt to stop you.

624
01:01:26,490 --> 01:01:31,490
It is clear that she
sees herself above you.

625
01:01:36,870 --> 01:01:40,870
When one of us is fire, the
other becomes water.

626
01:01:40,870 --> 01:01:43,290
So that we don't act in anger and harm us.

627
01:01:44,260 --> 01:01:48,770
You must be thinking very carefully.

628
01:01:48,770 --> 01:01:50,770
This is why you are wrong.

629
01:01:53,820 --> 01:01:58,070
I am more sure the more I get to know you.

630
01:01:58,070 --> 01:02:00,930
Aladdin Bey will become a very good Bey.

631
01:02:04,590 --> 01:02:08,020
Don't look at me like that, Bala Hatun.

632
01:02:09,920 --> 01:02:14,460
You also know that the young are
seated on the throne in Kayı tradition.

633
01:02:14,480 --> 01:02:16,480
And adults open the way for them.

634
01:02:17,110 --> 01:02:21,390
Orhan Bey will be a great
support for his brother on this path.

635
01:02:23,820 --> 01:02:35,130
But I don't think Malhun Hatun
can handle that.

636
01:02:37,430 --> 01:02:39,490
She may get in your way.

637
01:02:43,340 --> 01:02:48,110
The mother should stand behind her son.

638
01:02:50,490 --> 01:02:54,540
I am Mother Sultan today
because I stood behind my son.

639
01:02:55,090 --> 01:02:59,430
People like you and I have
no other choice.

640
01:03:00,570 --> 01:03:04,430
Because of your preoccupation
with these matters in the palace...

641
01:03:05,050 --> 01:03:08,650
You could not see the
truth in our eyes, Sultan Mother.

642
01:03:10,650 --> 01:03:14,020
Whether Orhan sits on
the throne or Aladdin...

643
01:03:14,340 --> 01:03:17,100
They are both my sons.

644
01:03:18,270 --> 01:03:21,490
When the throne and position
interfere in the matter...

645
01:03:22,390 --> 01:03:25,850
There is no brotherhood or kinship left.

646
01:03:27,030 --> 01:03:29,570
You know this.

647
01:03:30,330 --> 01:03:36,140
As a mother, never forget what
I am going to say now.

648
01:03:37,200 --> 01:03:40,040
Stand behind your son.

649
01:03:40,250 --> 01:03:45,100
Don't leave him alone on this
bloody and dark path.

650
01:03:49,720 --> 01:03:54,270
Neither Malhun Hatun nor me
differentiate between the children.

651
01:03:54,700 --> 01:03:58,490
If the topic is related to the state
or if it is related to the case...

652
01:03:58,650 --> 01:04:01,170
Our eyes don't see the throne.

653
01:04:02,030 --> 01:04:03,330
Thank you.

654
01:04:03,380 --> 01:04:05,160
Is that why....

655
01:04:05,550 --> 01:04:15,120
Malhun Hatun was saddened by the gifts
the Sultan had sent to Aladdin.

656
01:04:22,480 --> 01:04:30,060
If you had seen Malhun Hatun's face whe
I told Aladdin that Beyhood was worthy of him...

657
01:04:30,730 --> 01:04:36,170
You wouldn't have
spoken like that now, Bala Hatun.

658
01:04:39,440 --> 01:04:45,070
It's clear that Malhun Hatun has
her sights set on the throne...

659
01:04:45,415 --> 01:04:49,135
as she's the daughter of Bey
and Orhan being the eldest son.

660
01:04:49,720 --> 01:04:52,650
Consider me bad too.

661
01:04:52,920 --> 01:04:55,890
I only think of you.

662
01:05:10,150 --> 01:05:14,560
- What is this for?
- This is for my son.

663
01:05:14,690 --> 01:05:18,290
Sultan Aladdin's ring.

664
01:05:18,830 --> 01:05:23,380
His gift to Aladdin
Bey, who will be a Bey.

665
01:05:23,540 --> 01:05:27,760
As his mother, I would
like you to take it.

666
01:05:37,185 --> 01:05:39,685
Marmaracık Castle

667
01:05:43,685 --> 01:05:45,215
Thank you.

668
01:05:49,485 --> 01:05:53,215
We didn't find who locked the door.

669
01:05:57,685 --> 01:05:58,905
I told you.

670
01:06:00,330 --> 01:06:03,840
Bala Hatun must have locked him up
before she got out

671
01:06:03,900 --> 01:06:09,490
We will find him,
but what about Mother Sultan?

672
01:06:11,150 --> 01:06:15,320
Mother Sultan is more of a demon than
we could have imagined, Oktem Bey.

673
01:06:15,510 --> 01:06:18,240
She looks like she wants to
get close to Bala.

674
01:06:18,400 --> 01:06:23,870
But the punishment for their insolence
will be heavier than imprisonment.

675
01:06:27,980 --> 01:06:31,230
Tell me already!

676
01:06:31,440 --> 01:06:34,550
Yenişehir Market, Oktem Bey.

677
01:06:34,770 --> 01:06:36,090
Yes?

678
01:06:36,720 --> 01:06:38,560
It will be ours.

679
01:06:42,180 --> 01:06:48,270
When Mother Sultan takes control of Yenişehir,
the market will be under our rule.

680
01:06:48,480 --> 01:06:51,110
What does she want in return?

681
01:06:51,810 --> 01:06:56,280
It is enough for us to be
by her side and stand with her.

682
01:06:58,550 --> 01:07:05,420
We will not stand by Osman who humiliated
our daughter and us.

683
01:07:08,750 --> 01:07:11,700
Do not even remind me, Hatun.

684
01:07:13,400 --> 01:07:17,670
I control myself so that
my anger does not take over my mind.

685
01:07:19,510 --> 01:07:22,950
Otherwise, I know what I'd do to him.

686
01:07:24,380 --> 01:07:27,470
You tell me not to remind but...

687
01:07:27,790 --> 01:07:33,070
I will never forget what they did
to my daughter, Oktem Bey.

688
01:07:34,040 --> 01:07:35,890
You shouldn't either.

689
01:07:35,950 --> 01:07:40,090
Always remember this,
so don't forget whom you should support.

690
01:07:40,260 --> 01:07:44,460
The people who backdoor us
will obey us...

691
01:07:44,620 --> 01:07:49,510
...after we start ruling the market.

692
01:08:04,180 --> 01:08:10,480
The command of Mother Sultan is clear.

693
01:08:11,590 --> 01:08:17,698
I thought she would hold a court,
even if it was just a formality, but...

694
01:08:18,029 --> 01:08:20,080
...praise be upon her.

695
01:08:20,569 --> 01:08:24,380
She never leaves it up to chance.

696
01:08:24,600 --> 01:08:28,060
The people love Osman,
they would try to stop her.

697
01:08:28,279 --> 01:08:31,988
This is clear, this is clear.

698
01:08:32,260 --> 01:08:37,399
She found a way to trick people.

699
01:08:38,510 --> 01:08:40,779
Huseyin.

700
01:08:43,430 --> 01:08:46,460
She says "kill Osman".

701
01:08:46,810 --> 01:08:48,920
Are we going to do it, my Bey?

702
01:08:49,158 --> 01:08:52,760
The command is clear, Huseyin.

703
01:08:53,870 --> 01:08:57,689
- You're right, my Bey.
- I'm absolutely right.

704
01:09:01,500 --> 01:09:04,500
We obey commands.

705
01:09:05,609 --> 01:09:08,399
We love gold.

706
01:09:08,988 --> 01:09:15,948
We will implement everything
that Mother Sultan says.

707
01:09:16,300 --> 01:09:22,170
Which means gold and wealth.

708
01:09:25,520 --> 01:09:27,029
Right now...

709
01:09:28,850 --> 01:09:34,649
Find me 10 men, no,
that's not enough, find me 20 men...

710
01:09:36,274 --> 01:09:40,725
...among Mother Sultan's men.

711
01:09:44,729 --> 01:09:50,520
It is time to get rid of this.

712
01:09:51,790 --> 01:09:55,500
- As you command, my Bey.
- Go on.

713
01:10:02,020 --> 01:10:06,180
You sleep in the bed you make, Osman.

714
01:10:08,940 --> 01:10:11,730
We directed Sultan where we want.

715
01:10:11,860 --> 01:10:13,510
However...

716
01:10:13,650 --> 01:10:17,810
- Will Mesut make a move?
- He will.

717
01:10:18,520 --> 01:10:21,090
The Sultan is young.

718
01:10:21,390 --> 01:10:23,550
But he is clever.

719
01:10:23,870 --> 01:10:28,550
I am sure I have made myself
crystal clear against him.

720
01:10:29,280 --> 01:10:32,450
Maybe he didn't believe,
but we placed the doubt in his mind.

721
01:10:32,640 --> 01:10:36,160
Whether it is us or the Ilkhanians,
it makes no difference.

722
01:10:36,670 --> 01:10:41,620
He will have to order
the death of Sultan Mesut.

723
01:10:41,840 --> 01:10:46,110
This will lead us to the Sultan.

724
01:10:46,380 --> 01:10:49,440
And we will find the Sultan before them.

725
01:10:50,250 --> 01:10:53,500
If we have Sultan Mesut on the throne...

726
01:10:53,900 --> 01:10:59,100
Then Konya will provide everything
necessary for all the conquests.

727
01:10:59,240 --> 01:11:01,000
Inshallah my Bey.

728
01:11:01,020 --> 01:11:04,290
Inshallah, Inshallah.

729
01:11:07,330 --> 01:11:09,380
My uncle.

730
01:11:12,995 --> 01:11:15,245
He used to tell me all the time.

731
01:11:19,330 --> 01:11:21,950
Everything is for the state.

732
01:11:23,430 --> 01:11:27,340
A bloodless throne
is not a throne.

733
01:11:28,630 --> 01:11:32,260
- Salevi!
- My Sultan.

734
01:11:37,940 --> 01:11:41,430
My Uncle Mesut will be
executed by strangulation.

735
01:11:42,920 --> 01:11:47,950
- Hadrat Sultan!
- It doesn't matter who does it.

736
01:11:49,090 --> 01:11:53,330
Mesut will constantly threaten
my authority as long as he lives.

737
01:11:54,500 --> 01:11:56,550
If not today, then tomorrow.

738
01:11:56,900 --> 01:11:58,930
They will use him as long as he is alive.

739
01:11:59,280 --> 01:12:00,540
Hadrat Sultan...

740
01:12:00,550 --> 01:12:04,360
If you speak another word,
I'll consider you a traitor!

741
01:12:05,260 --> 01:12:11,350
I will separate your head from your body
and hang at the gates of Konya, Vizier

742
01:12:15,160 --> 01:12:19,280
As you command, Hadrat Sultan Aladdin.

743
01:12:43,080 --> 01:12:45,420
Gather a unit of loyal Mongol soldiers.

744
01:12:45,420 --> 01:12:49,690
Pick the ones whose tongues will be
cut off, whose eyes will be gouged out...

745
01:12:49,690 --> 01:12:50,930
...after this is over.

746
01:12:50,930 --> 01:12:53,400
You are going to the palace in Karakoy.

747
01:12:57,550 --> 01:13:00,180
Tell me, are the preparations done?

748
01:13:00,340 --> 01:13:03,750
- We have prepared, my Bey.
- Eyvallah (okay)

749
01:13:04,020 --> 01:13:06,260
Can I come in my Bey?

750
01:13:06,700 --> 01:13:09,510
Come in Boran!

751
01:13:14,160 --> 01:13:19,550
They are keeping
Sultan Mesut in Karakoy palace, my Bey.

752
01:13:19,710 --> 01:13:21,720
Nice.

753
01:13:22,230 --> 01:13:24,500
The news has arrived.

754
01:13:25,090 --> 01:13:28,150
We know where Sultan Mesut is now.

755
01:13:28,580 --> 01:13:34,480
...we'll save him for our victory.

756
01:13:34,910 --> 01:13:37,460
However, we have to stay on alert
once we get there.

757
01:13:37,670 --> 01:13:40,220
Keep this in mind.

758
01:13:41,650 --> 01:13:44,680
- Let's go.
- My Bey!

759
01:13:45,540 --> 01:13:49,100
What about Aladdin?

760
01:13:50,430 --> 01:13:53,010
You will save Aladdin.

761
01:13:53,050 --> 01:13:54,430
How, my Bey?

762
01:13:54,520 --> 01:13:58,530
Don't worry, you won't be alone
in the palace.

763
01:13:59,700 --> 01:14:03,300
Turahan is in disguise of a soldier.
He is with Aladdin.

764
01:14:03,680 --> 01:14:06,400
Also, Samil will scout for you.

765
01:14:07,140 --> 01:14:08,910
As you command, my Bey.

766
01:14:09,300 --> 01:14:11,550
Eyvallah (thank you)
Let's go.

767
01:14:37,785 --> 01:14:47,345
Apparently, we will not fight
with the pens today, but with the swords.

768
01:14:47,430 --> 01:14:49,130
Osman Bey!

769
01:15:00,485 --> 01:15:04,265
Where is Osman Bey, Dursun Fakih?

770
01:15:05,055 --> 01:15:08,215
And what does he have to do with you,
Bayindir Bey?

771
01:15:08,405 --> 01:15:10,405
Nothing.

772
01:15:10,735 --> 01:15:13,435
I was going to talk to him a little bit.

773
01:15:13,705 --> 01:15:18,065
No problem, I'll talk later.

774
01:15:19,475 --> 01:15:22,025
But I will definitely talk to him.

775
01:15:53,440 --> 01:15:55,000
Damned woman!

776
01:15:56,110 --> 01:15:58,470
She had no one to pick on,
so she found me!

777
01:16:00,220 --> 01:16:01,720
I always say this.

778
01:16:01,720 --> 01:16:03,500
The evil always find me!

779
01:16:04,280 --> 01:16:05,810
Enough already!

780
01:16:25,300 --> 01:16:28,830
She believes that she can trample
everyone who stands in front of her...

781
01:16:28,830 --> 01:16:30,630
...because she has become a sultan.

782
01:16:47,790 --> 01:16:50,660
Don't cry anymore, you wasted yourself.

783
01:16:54,950 --> 01:16:56,520
Cerkutay.

784
01:17:00,910 --> 01:17:02,310
When the time comes...

785
01:17:04,590 --> 01:17:06,620
We'll make that Hatun pay.

786
01:17:08,160 --> 01:17:09,430
Oh look at that!

787
01:17:09,490 --> 01:17:13,000
He didn't see the onion.
He thinks I am crying because of her.

788
01:17:13,050 --> 01:17:15,840
Cerkutay, what a soft heart you have!

789
01:17:16,090 --> 01:17:17,420
Let's play.

790
01:17:18,650 --> 01:17:21,190
Right, Cerkutay?
We'll make her pay, right?

791
01:17:22,090 --> 01:17:25,310
Of course we will!
Don't be upset.

792
01:17:28,860 --> 01:17:30,720
I am not crying.

793
01:17:32,020 --> 01:17:33,580
Let that woman cry!

794
01:17:33,640 --> 01:17:37,200
Once Osman Bey comes, she will regret
everything she has done.

795
01:17:38,490 --> 01:17:39,800
So...

796
01:17:41,910 --> 01:17:43,980
Why are you crying so hard then?

797
01:17:45,770 --> 01:17:48,740
Nothing, I'm not crying about anything.

798
01:17:51,990 --> 01:17:57,750
Watever, why are you standing?
There is food if you are hungry.

799
01:17:57,750 --> 01:18:00,900
I won't care about what you eat and
drink anymore, feel free.

800
01:18:09,830 --> 01:18:12,350
She cries because she loves me.

801
01:18:12,350 --> 01:18:13,740
No, no I can't let her cry.

802
01:18:13,740 --> 01:18:17,000
I must do something.
I must do something.

803
01:18:17,510 --> 01:18:19,100
Ulgen...

804
01:18:20,660 --> 01:18:22,030
Sister.

805
01:18:22,670 --> 01:18:25,200
Now, I'm Cerkutay.

806
01:18:25,510 --> 01:18:29,230
I see Ulgen as a sister...

807
01:18:30,790 --> 01:18:32,600
...I mean, this situation...
Cerkut...

808
01:18:33,820 --> 01:18:37,620
What did you say?
I didn't hear, what did you say?

809
01:18:38,360 --> 01:18:41,140
- What did you say?
- I...

810
01:18:41,690 --> 01:18:43,550
What did I say?

811
01:18:43,550 --> 01:18:48,140
- I wanted to say that.
- Huh?

812
01:18:48,700 --> 01:18:51,700
Ulgen Hatun.

813
01:18:52,100 --> 01:18:54,670
- Hatun?
- Hatun.

814
01:18:55,000 --> 01:18:57,520
What about joining The Sisters(baciyans),
Ulgen Hatun?

815
01:18:57,520 --> 01:18:59,520
Get out, get out of here, Cerkutay Alp!

816
01:19:00,290 --> 01:19:01,680
I said get out!

817
01:19:01,680 --> 01:19:03,230
Get out, or we're
going to have an accident.

818
01:19:03,230 --> 01:19:04,760
Calm down.

819
01:19:06,110 --> 01:19:11,480
The thing in your hand...
drop it slowly...

820
01:19:11,860 --> 01:19:14,390
- Drop it.
- I told you to get out!

821
01:19:14,490 --> 01:19:16,610
We'll have an accident now!
Get out at once!

822
01:19:16,610 --> 01:19:17,800
Think about The Sisters (baciyans)

823
01:19:17,800 --> 01:19:20,000
He is still talking about baciyans!
Get out!

824
01:19:25,610 --> 01:19:28,180
Sister huh?
Sister!

825
01:19:29,750 --> 01:19:33,760
You're done, Cerkutay!
I'll end you!

826
01:19:34,400 --> 01:19:37,930
No, you are playing with me!

827
01:19:38,890 --> 01:19:42,080
No, I won't let him do that to me!

828
01:19:43,000 --> 01:19:48,440
I, Ulgen, won't love you anymore!

829
01:19:55,840 --> 01:19:59,980
Sometimes I say this is all a nightmare.

830
01:20:00,540 --> 01:20:02,360
I'll wake up and this will end.

831
01:20:03,630 --> 01:20:06,060
Aktemur will be the Aktmemur I know.

832
01:20:07,800 --> 01:20:12,760
Don't think about him anymore, Alcicek.
Isn't it Aktemur who put you in this situation?

833
01:20:15,400 --> 01:20:17,410
Maybe you didn't know him at all.

834
01:20:20,370 --> 01:20:23,900
He was always like this,
he had a bad heart

835
01:20:24,150 --> 01:20:27,560
No, Esma, you don't know.

836
01:20:27,560 --> 01:20:29,240
It's not just me.

837
01:20:29,240 --> 01:20:33,010
He does not do evil to anyone on purpose,
he cannot do that.

838
01:20:36,160 --> 01:20:41,900
...but I broke him so much, I broke him
so much.

839
01:20:45,320 --> 01:20:50,620
Foolish, my foolish daughter
still accuses herself!

840
01:20:51,030 --> 01:20:56,140
He can't believe my love anymore,
he's doing what he's doing because of this.

841
01:20:57,370 --> 01:20:59,880
Your love has blinded you, sister.

842
01:21:02,850 --> 01:21:05,420
Would a man who is in love with you
do that to you?

843
01:21:07,990 --> 01:21:10,050
Don't cry anymore, Alcicek.

844
01:21:14,250 --> 01:21:18,480
I wish my hands had been broken so
I hadn't locked Bengi Hatun in that room!

845
01:21:19,100 --> 01:21:22,920
Esma, what did you say?

846
01:21:23,720 --> 01:21:25,160
What did you say?

847
01:21:25,160 --> 01:21:27,160
- Mother, what are you doing?
- Let go of me!

848
01:21:31,270 --> 01:21:33,340
Mother we were just talking...

849
01:21:33,340 --> 01:21:36,840
Don't stand up for your partner,
Alcicek, don't!

850
01:21:38,460 --> 01:21:40,190
Forgive me, Bengi Hatun!

851
01:21:40,190 --> 01:21:42,210
If I had known this would happen
I would not have done it.

852
01:21:42,210 --> 01:21:46,680
I don't want you neither in my tribe
nor in my castle. Get out!

853
01:21:49,190 --> 01:21:52,770
The first thing you do tomorrow
is to pack up and leave!

854
01:21:52,870 --> 01:21:56,920
You shameless crud!
Go! Go!

855
01:22:01,880 --> 01:22:02,920
Mother!

856
01:22:03,530 --> 01:22:06,140
Don't say a word, Alcicek!
Sleep now!

857
01:22:06,510 --> 01:22:08,880
Otherwise, you won't be able to
get out of this room.

858
01:22:21,695 --> 01:22:23,395
Do I care about wealth?

859
01:22:26,425 --> 01:22:30,955
Then why is my heart
so tight inside this castle?

860
01:22:31,915 --> 01:22:35,955
My Creator, help me.

861
01:22:37,225 --> 01:22:38,975
Show me a way.

862
01:22:47,695 --> 01:22:49,075
My sheikh.

863
01:22:51,995 --> 01:22:53,525
Welcome.

864
01:22:54,775 --> 01:22:58,585
- Peace be upon you.
- Peace be upon you too.

865
01:22:58,585 --> 01:23:00,145
You brought peace.

866
01:23:03,305 --> 01:23:05,025
Here, my sheik.

867
01:23:07,655 --> 01:23:10,055
It's not the time to sit down, Turgut Bey.

868
01:23:13,555 --> 01:23:17,415
The enemy
has surrounded us on all four sides...

869
01:23:17,415 --> 01:23:20,345
This is not the time to
lean back and relax.

870
01:23:21,935 --> 01:23:24,695
You too, my sheikh?! You, too?

871
01:23:27,465 --> 01:23:30,915
Do you reproach yourself or us?

872
01:23:32,895 --> 01:23:35,655
Question this first of all, Turgut Bey.

873
01:23:37,655 --> 01:23:41,615
You cannot bear the words that
will come out of my mouth

874
01:23:42,115 --> 01:23:45,405
Not at all, my sheikh,
how do you say that?

875
01:23:46,095 --> 01:23:52,265
I am only saying that you always stand with
Osman Bey about our issue.

876
01:23:53,275 --> 01:23:56,935
I wish you looked at it
in my persepctive too.

877
01:23:57,455 --> 01:24:02,845
This is not about Osman Bey.
This is not about Turgut Bey either.

878
01:24:03,705 --> 01:24:09,635
The infidels and the hypocrites unite
and prepare to make the us starve!

879
01:24:10,515 --> 01:24:12,325
They are keeping our supplies.

880
01:24:13,515 --> 01:24:17,925
It is time to defend the rights
of Muslims first.

881
01:24:18,575 --> 01:24:21,545
It is the time to defend against
to the infidels.

882
01:24:22,435 --> 01:24:25,555
Your issue comes later.

883
01:24:26,165 --> 01:24:31,885
But when the time comes,
we'll talk about it, too

884
01:24:34,235 --> 01:24:38,315
If you gave up on Osman, not our case,
you are fine.

885
01:24:39,235 --> 01:24:43,975
Defend your case, Turgut Bey.

886
01:24:45,685 --> 01:24:50,205
Do not let the infidels
take your people's supply.

887
01:24:51,275 --> 01:24:52,635
Don't let them.

888
01:24:57,065 --> 01:24:58,635
I will be back.

889
01:25:05,035 --> 01:25:12,185
No matter what happens, I won't let anyone
steal Turkmens' supply, my sheik.

890
01:25:15,235 --> 01:25:18,785
- Kutan!
- Yes my Bey.

891
01:25:19,155 --> 01:25:23,745
Prepare the alps now, we will attack
the infidels in the morning.

892
01:25:25,115 --> 01:25:26,675
Your command, my Bey.

893
01:25:38,905 --> 01:25:40,975
- Father.
- No!

894
01:25:49,015 --> 01:25:50,595
Hands off!

895
01:25:54,445 --> 01:25:55,815
Son.

896
01:26:01,365 --> 01:26:04,365
If even a strand of his hair is hurt...

897
01:26:07,935 --> 01:26:14,215
I will demolish this palace over your head.
Keep this in your mind.

898
01:26:28,495 --> 01:26:32,015
- Son.
- We made it, father.

899
01:26:37,215 --> 01:26:38,925
You are the one who made it.

900
01:26:41,275 --> 01:26:43,015
You did your job properly.

901
01:26:46,255 --> 01:26:50,325
Don't worry, the rest is on your father.

902
01:26:52,445 --> 01:26:59,845
Don't feel like a prisoner here.

903
01:27:03,165 --> 01:27:04,735
Captivitiy is nothing, father.

904
01:27:06,215 --> 01:27:10,375
My sole purpose is to put my neck
under the knife, like Hadrat Ismail.

905
01:27:10,505 --> 01:27:14,035
May you achieve victory
in the blessed path you are walking.

906
01:27:15,935 --> 01:27:17,265
Son.

907
01:27:24,645 --> 01:27:28,875
You carry out your campaign, we'll taste
martyrdom if necessary.

908
01:27:29,755 --> 01:27:31,645
You are a gift from Allah to me.

909
01:27:32,035 --> 01:27:34,525
I will not leave you with these,
do not worry.

910
01:27:43,925 --> 01:27:46,405
If something happens to you.

911
01:27:49,785 --> 01:27:54,815
I will return to demolish this place
over their heads, do not worry.

912
01:27:57,655 --> 01:27:59,355
May Allah protect you.

913
01:28:06,015 --> 01:28:08,025
May your path be open, Osman Bey.

914
01:28:09,475 --> 01:28:13,065
Eyvallah.
Eyvallah son.

915
01:28:28,505 --> 01:28:29,825
Mother.

916
01:28:32,340 --> 01:28:34,900
What will we do if we can't find supplies?

917
01:28:36,930 --> 01:28:43,990
Dear Orhan, it is not appropriate for you
as a Bey to ask this question.

918
01:28:45,330 --> 01:28:48,120
A Bey plans his moves in advance.

919
01:28:48,120 --> 01:28:51,330
And if he doesn't have a plan,
he doesn't reveal it.

920
01:28:51,940 --> 01:28:53,730
You are right, mother.

921
01:28:54,250 --> 01:28:56,130
I made a mistake, forgive me.

922
01:28:57,430 --> 01:28:59,270
Not a mistake, son.

923
01:28:59,890 --> 01:29:04,570
You will learn this way,
but let this be a lesson for you

924
01:29:04,950 --> 01:29:10,490
Don't, don't seem despair
in front of your people and alps.

925
01:29:11,090 --> 01:29:14,760
You will always support them as a Bey.

926
01:29:14,760 --> 01:29:16,760
They will see the power in you.

927
01:29:18,180 --> 01:29:22,030
You will be tested with these
when you sit on the throne soon.

928
01:29:22,030 --> 01:29:25,160
You'd better think about this talk
before the day comes.

929
01:29:25,470 --> 01:29:28,820
I am ready, mother.
I will be ready for that day.

930
01:29:32,930 --> 01:29:36,040
Malhun Hatun has set
her sights on the throne

931
01:29:36,630 --> 01:29:42,050
Being the daughter of a Bey and
Orhan being the eldest son, that is clear.

932
01:29:43,620 --> 01:29:45,730
You may think I am the bad here.

933
01:29:46,900 --> 01:29:48,490
But I only think about you.

934
01:30:02,910 --> 01:30:04,690
Welcome, Bala.

935
01:30:05,690 --> 01:30:09,660
What happened?
Why did Mother Sultan call you?

936
01:30:15,080 --> 01:30:18,670
Nothing, she spoke nonsense again.

937
01:30:20,030 --> 01:30:22,300
Didn't she say anything important at all?

938
01:30:24,610 --> 01:30:26,410
Or are you hiding from me?

939
01:30:27,530 --> 01:30:30,250
What do we have to hide
from each other, Malhun?

940
01:30:32,820 --> 01:30:34,600
Or do you have?

941
01:30:35,210 --> 01:30:37,310
No, I don't.

942
01:30:43,690 --> 01:30:46,350
So, there is nothing to tell.

943
01:30:48,800 --> 01:30:51,400
What did you do?
Is there any news?

944
01:30:53,790 --> 01:30:56,100
We placed scouts in the caves

945
01:30:56,800 --> 01:31:00,620
We will get our supplies
back as soon as we know where they are.

946
01:31:01,790 --> 01:31:04,260
They can't hide anything from us anymore.

947
01:31:04,760 --> 01:31:07,510
Every secret will surely
be revealed one day.

948
01:31:08,330 --> 01:31:09,690
Eyvallah.

949
01:31:11,870 --> 01:31:13,720
And what about Osman Bey?

950
01:31:14,340 --> 01:31:16,370
Is there news about them?

951
01:31:16,740 --> 01:31:18,080
No.

952
01:31:18,520 --> 01:31:20,570
But they will be victorious, Inshallah.

953
01:31:21,230 --> 01:31:22,450
Inshallah.

954
01:31:24,990 --> 01:31:26,700
Excuse me now.

955
01:31:34,850 --> 01:31:36,650
I hope nothing is bad.

956
01:31:42,090 --> 01:31:44,390
Kopru Hisar.

957
01:31:44,960 --> 01:31:48,000
Did my order reach the
Christian villages near Yenisehir?

958
01:31:48,000 --> 01:31:49,570
Yes sir.

959
01:31:50,020 --> 01:31:54,050
The people will not trade with
Yenişehir under any circumstances

960
01:31:54,220 --> 01:31:59,860
What about provisions in and around castles?
You know it's very valuable to us.

961
01:32:00,090 --> 01:32:01,860
Everything has been resolved.

962
01:32:02,360 --> 01:32:07,300
Dan and Frody collect them in Petibi Cave.

963
01:32:08,470 --> 01:32:10,580
Turks may come after them.

964
01:32:11,250 --> 01:32:12,360
Hey, Olof.

965
01:32:12,930 --> 01:32:16,410
If they take them, it will be over.

966
01:32:16,920 --> 01:32:19,010
They can't find the cave.

967
01:32:19,380 --> 01:32:24,500
And if they find him,
my soldiers will end them.

968
01:32:24,930 --> 01:32:26,460
Good.

969
01:32:26,460 --> 01:32:29,390
No supplies will remain around Yenişehir.

970
01:32:30,010 --> 01:32:35,160
Then their people will start talking
about starvation.

971
01:32:37,000 --> 01:32:40,310
And this hunger will break their unity, Olof.

972
01:32:41,040 --> 01:32:47,050
Mother Sultan will take advantage of this
and destroy Osman's reputation.

973
01:32:48,440 --> 01:32:51,510
It means that Mother Sultan
will make them kneel.

974
01:32:51,890 --> 01:32:54,310
And we will beat them to death.

975
01:32:58,660 --> 01:32:59,990
What about the castles?

976
01:33:00,290 --> 01:33:04,830
Can she do the same to us
to get the castles?

977
01:33:05,210 --> 01:33:06,590
No.

978
01:33:06,870 --> 01:33:10,430
Mother Sultan
only wants Yenişehir and Sogut.

979
01:33:10,820 --> 01:33:13,610
She is ready to hand over
castles and palaces to us.

980
01:33:22,560 --> 01:33:24,100
Fill me up.

981
01:33:33,550 --> 01:33:35,310
Turgut Bey.

982
01:33:35,980 --> 01:33:39,110
Why did he invite us, Beys?

983
01:33:44,820 --> 01:33:48,700
We'll get the answer to the question that's
gnawing inside you, Sahin Bey.

984
01:34:04,600 --> 01:34:06,680
Brave Turkish tribal Beys.

985
01:34:09,390 --> 01:34:10,970
Welcome.

986
01:34:12,030 --> 01:34:14,070
Eyvalalh Turgut Bey.

987
01:34:16,925 --> 01:34:18,375
What is it, Demirhan Bey?

988
01:34:18,835 --> 01:34:22,615
Is there something bothers you
that makes you stand apart from us?

989
01:34:22,845 --> 01:34:24,735
What is your intention, Turgut Bey?

990
01:34:25,635 --> 01:34:29,205
You betrayed your brothers with whom
you shared your meal in the past.

991
01:34:30,535 --> 01:34:33,115
Are you going to ask us
the same thing now?

992
01:34:33,155 --> 01:34:37,195
I did not abandon for one moment
the cause of Islam in which I started!

993
01:34:38,965 --> 01:34:41,035
This is why I called you.

994
01:34:41,355 --> 01:34:46,465
You defended the castles yhat you conquered
with your souls and blood!

995
01:34:47,315 --> 01:34:50,975
You risked your life.
You wanted to taste martyrdom.

996
01:34:51,375 --> 01:34:52,965
We lost a lot.

997
01:34:53,095 --> 01:34:54,605
We fought a lot.

998
01:34:54,645 --> 01:34:56,875
But what did Mother Sultan do?

999
01:34:57,505 --> 01:35:01,665
She placed Olof and his men
in those castles!

1000
01:35:02,135 --> 01:35:06,635
We heard that when this happened you were
at the same table with the Sultana Mother

1001
01:35:07,045 --> 01:35:09,425
While we stood with Osman Bey...

1002
01:35:09,425 --> 01:35:11,985
...you were on their side, helping them.

1003
01:35:11,985 --> 01:35:13,845
I didn't help them at all!

1004
01:35:14,645 --> 01:35:18,595
I heard what happened that day at the same
time as you, I didn't know anything earlier.

1005
01:35:21,095 --> 01:35:22,965
What I want to do here...

1006
01:35:25,715 --> 01:35:28,825
What I want to do is a counter campaign.

1007
01:35:30,245 --> 01:35:32,095
Say what your plan is.

1008
01:35:32,225 --> 01:35:33,565
No.

1009
01:35:33,975 --> 01:35:35,525
You don't know me.

1010
01:35:36,795 --> 01:35:41,675
I didn't hand over my homeland even to
Osman Bey, whom I considered my brother.

1011
01:35:42,025 --> 01:35:44,595
How do you think I could give it
to Olof and his dogs?

1012
01:35:44,895 --> 01:35:47,455
That land was watered with my
martyr brothers' blood!

1013
01:35:47,645 --> 01:35:51,165
That land is our children's right!
You have no idea how manly I am!

1014
01:35:54,375 --> 01:35:55,875
Beys!

1015
01:35:57,335 --> 01:35:59,715
While we quarrel among us here...

1016
01:36:00,785 --> 01:36:02,305
The infidels do not stop.

1017
01:36:02,495 --> 01:36:04,565
The infidels continue their cruelty.

1018
01:36:05,445 --> 01:36:08,025
And now they will take t
he supplies which were ours.

1019
01:36:08,275 --> 01:36:10,395
And they put them in the cave of Betibi.

1020
01:36:14,295 --> 01:36:18,365
It is clear that their intention is to
defeat the Turkmens through starvation.

1021
01:36:19,525 --> 01:36:21,845
But we will not allow them to do so!

1022
01:36:22,725 --> 01:36:25,835
We'll attack that cave
at the most unexpected moment!

1023
01:36:26,275 --> 01:36:28,825
And it will be us who will defeat
Olof and his men!

1024
01:36:31,865 --> 01:36:33,715
Now tell me, Beys.

1025
01:36:34,375 --> 01:36:39,185
Are you with me on this blessed path?

1026
01:36:53,095 --> 01:36:54,395
My Bey!

1027
01:36:56,360 --> 01:36:59,200
As you ordered, we have tracked them down.

1028
01:36:59,200 --> 01:37:03,080
They entered a sheltered house
on the north side, before the mosque.

1029
01:37:03,310 --> 01:37:05,140
Does the courtyard of the house
open to the street?

1030
01:37:05,140 --> 01:37:06,730
Yes, my Bey.

1031
01:37:07,390 --> 01:37:09,100
Take us there.

1032
01:37:12,660 --> 01:37:14,380
Come on, alps.

1033
01:37:17,940 --> 01:37:20,480
Osman will not be able to
return from Konya.

1034
01:37:20,840 --> 01:37:23,670
All his units will have dispersed
in his absence.

1035
01:37:24,260 --> 01:37:26,840
There is no force that
can keep them together.

1036
01:37:27,340 --> 01:37:29,800
We'll strike the final blow soon, Olof.

1037
01:37:29,800 --> 01:37:35,800
And when Osman dies, we will seize
his castles, lands and everything he owns.

1038
01:37:38,870 --> 01:37:42,280
You always talk about good things,
Kantakouzanos.

1039
01:37:43,380 --> 01:37:46,100
Famine will make them kill each other.

1040
01:37:46,590 --> 01:37:49,950
Osman's death will be the end of them.

1041
01:37:51,990 --> 01:37:54,300
Why don't you think of the bad?

1042
01:37:55,070 --> 01:37:59,160
What if Osman has Mesut on the throne...

1043
01:37:59,260 --> 01:38:05,300
What if he marches to us with
a large Seljuk army?

1044
01:38:09,500 --> 01:38:12,560
Is that possible?

1045
01:38:14,020 --> 01:38:17,880
It's not possible, it's not.

1046
01:38:18,600 --> 01:38:21,100
Osman can't get out of there alive.

1047
01:38:22,300 --> 01:38:24,000
If he does...

1048
01:38:25,960 --> 01:38:30,960
Here he will face a rebellious
people dying of starvation.

1049
01:38:40,110 --> 01:38:42,110
How long will this situation continue,
my brothers?

1050
01:38:42,110 --> 01:38:44,070
Osman Bey is not present!

1051
01:38:44,070 --> 01:38:46,980
And there is no news from the caravans?

1052
01:38:46,980 --> 01:38:49,320
Where is Osman Bey?

1053
01:38:49,320 --> 01:38:50,770
This can't go on like this!

1054
01:38:50,770 --> 01:38:52,910
What will happen to us
if they don't arrive?

1055
01:38:52,910 --> 01:38:54,620
That's what I am talking about?

1056
01:38:54,620 --> 01:38:57,580
We are left alone!
The winter has come!

1057
01:38:57,580 --> 01:39:00,870
What are we going to eat and drink
if those caravans don't arrive?

1058
01:39:01,780 --> 01:39:03,750
If we can't solve this...

1059
01:39:03,750 --> 01:39:06,700
..I will talk to Mother Sultan.

1060
01:39:06,700 --> 01:39:09,670
We will come with you too!

1061
01:39:09,730 --> 01:39:12,230
This cannot go on like this!
Where is Osman Bey?

1062
01:39:12,230 --> 01:39:13,480
What are we going to do?

1063
01:39:18,390 --> 01:39:21,390
Let's go all together!

1064
01:39:43,120 --> 01:39:44,920
Why did we come here?

1065
01:39:45,840 --> 01:39:48,420
Why have you brought me here
where I was kicked out?

1066
01:39:48,980 --> 01:39:50,820
Shut up and walk, Esma.

1067
01:39:51,920 --> 01:39:54,830
Bala Hatun will not let you
out in the street like that.

1068
01:39:55,320 --> 01:39:56,620
Come on.

1069
01:40:01,390 --> 01:40:04,390
- What are you doing here?
- Do not worry.

1070
01:40:05,710 --> 01:40:07,360
I did not come for you, Subasi.

1071
01:40:13,100 --> 01:40:15,280
- Alcicek.
- Bala Hatun.

1072
01:40:18,060 --> 01:40:22,380
Don't misunderstand me...
we didn't want to come like this, however...

1073
01:40:28,240 --> 01:40:32,140
There is nothing to misunderstand.
You can come whenever you want, Alcicek

1074
01:40:34,700 --> 01:40:36,060
Esma.

1075
01:40:37,980 --> 01:40:40,100
What happened to you?
Who did this to you?

1076
01:40:41,920 --> 01:40:43,300
My mother.

1077
01:40:45,140 --> 01:40:50,360
When my mother heard that the one who l
ocked the door was Esma, she went crazy

1078
01:40:51,900 --> 01:40:53,400
She kicked Esma out.

1079
01:40:56,100 --> 01:41:00,110
...she had nowhere to go and
I thought that...

1080
01:41:00,110 --> 01:41:01,640
...you thought well.

1081
01:41:04,460 --> 01:41:05,850
Esma.

1082
01:41:06,240 --> 01:41:09,800
This place is your home, too,
from now on. You are welcome.

1083
01:41:11,980 --> 01:41:13,720
No.

1084
01:41:17,520 --> 01:41:21,760
May Allah be pleased with you,
I won't forget this favor of yours.

1085
01:41:24,630 --> 01:41:27,400
May Allah be pleased with you,
Esma daughter.

1086
01:41:27,840 --> 01:41:33,600
Other than that, you are not the one who
made the mistake, so you shouldn't suffer.

1087
01:41:35,680 --> 01:41:40,120
From now on, you will be under
our care, Esma.

1088
01:42:07,900 --> 01:42:10,060
When both your mother and father died...

1089
01:42:10,860 --> 01:42:14,520
I did not differentiate between
you and my daughter, Esma.

1090
01:42:15,270 --> 01:42:20,100
I took care of you and your sister,
is this the return?

1091
01:42:20,420 --> 01:42:24,700
Forgive me, Bengi Hatun,
I did something stupid

1092
01:42:25,390 --> 01:42:28,420
I couldn't take it when I saw
Alcicek Hautn so sad.

1093
01:42:28,420 --> 01:42:31,100
You betrayed me, Esma.

1094
01:42:32,270 --> 01:42:34,030
You can't stay here anymore.

1095
01:42:34,760 --> 01:42:39,310
I'll go, I'll go but...

1096
01:42:41,750 --> 01:42:43,860
I have no one.

1097
01:42:44,640 --> 01:42:46,760
The place you are going is clear.

1098
01:42:48,230 --> 01:42:54,780
You will go to them, those who
caused you to get kicked out of here.

1099
01:42:59,060 --> 01:43:01,500
You will go to Yenişehir Palace.

1100
01:43:04,540 --> 01:43:06,880
You will be my eyes and ears there.

1101
01:43:09,870 --> 01:43:11,600
I can't do this, Bengi Hatun.

1102
01:43:11,600 --> 01:43:14,470
You should have thought
of that before you betrayed me.

1103
01:43:15,300 --> 01:43:18,830
Your sister will stay with me here,
in front of my eyes

1104
01:43:19,040 --> 01:43:21,030
And you will go to the palace.

1105
01:43:21,030 --> 01:43:23,940
- How am I going to do that, Bengi Hatun?
- You will.

1106
01:43:24,320 --> 01:43:25,660
You will.

1107
01:43:26,600 --> 01:43:29,460
If you don't want your sister to
lose her ears and eyes...

1108
01:43:29,560 --> 01:43:31,560
...You will do what I say.

1109
01:43:31,560 --> 01:43:35,040
My foolish daughter must
take you to Yenişehir.

1110
01:43:35,440 --> 01:43:39,740
May Allah be pleased with you, Bala Hatun,
Ayse Hatun.

1111
01:43:40,700 --> 01:43:42,550
I will never forget this favor of you.

1112
01:43:43,780 --> 01:43:46,280
Make yourself comfortable, Alcicek.

1113
01:43:46,420 --> 01:43:47,980
Don't worry.

1114
01:43:48,760 --> 01:43:51,290
Your sister is entrusted
to us, my daughter.

1115
01:43:52,360 --> 01:43:55,150
Also, don't blame yourself anymore.

1116
01:43:59,480 --> 01:44:02,720
Esma daughter, come on,
let's get you settled in your room.

1117
01:44:02,720 --> 01:44:04,030
Come.

1118
01:44:13,760 --> 01:44:15,320
Alcicek.

1119
01:44:18,240 --> 01:44:20,740
Do you still want to join
The Sisters (baciyan)

1120
01:44:27,180 --> 01:44:33,260
Bala hatun, the people have begun to
congregate in the market.

1121
01:44:40,400 --> 01:44:43,960
Why did the caravan stop coming?
It used to come all the time!

1122
01:44:43,960 --> 01:44:45,500
He says right!

1123
01:44:45,500 --> 01:44:48,060
Is this how you keep your promise?

1124
01:44:48,480 --> 01:44:52,040
Will our trade agreement expire when
Osman Bey is absent?

1125
01:44:52,230 --> 01:44:55,600
This is not working!

1126
01:44:56,880 --> 01:45:00,800
Beys!
Beys!

1127
01:45:05,420 --> 01:45:08,540
Didn't we tell you to wait,
that we would bring the caravans?

1128
01:45:08,540 --> 01:45:09,680
What are you doing now?

1129
01:45:09,680 --> 01:45:11,680
Waiting doesn't fill our hunger,
Bala Hatun.

1130
01:45:12,190 --> 01:45:14,780
You are too busy with your
own issues...

1131
01:45:14,790 --> 01:45:16,780
...while we face starvation here!

1132
01:45:16,780 --> 01:45:19,300
There is no starvation, Bekir Bey!

1133
01:45:19,300 --> 01:45:21,710
Famine is much greater than
two missed caravans.

1134
01:45:21,710 --> 01:45:23,760
You don't know anything.

1135
01:45:23,760 --> 01:45:25,360
Whatever Osman Bey did...

1136
01:45:25,360 --> 01:45:29,710
Even the Christian villagers in the
neighborhood don't sell us their food.

1137
01:45:29,850 --> 01:45:32,060
They say the agreements are over.

1138
01:45:32,060 --> 01:45:34,090
He says right.

1139
01:45:34,490 --> 01:45:36,200
What will happen to us?

1140
01:45:36,200 --> 01:45:37,250
We will perish.

1141
01:45:38,910 --> 01:45:40,480
What shall we do?

1142
01:45:47,140 --> 01:45:52,260
If Malhun can't find the supplies,
things will get very messy.

1143
01:45:53,260 --> 01:45:56,320
Aktemur, you and alps stay on guard.

1144
01:45:56,320 --> 01:45:58,320
Looks like they won't keep quiet.

1145
01:45:59,100 --> 01:46:00,850
Kutlu! Come on.

1146
01:46:01,930 --> 01:46:04,480
This is not how you manage a market!

1147
01:46:31,580 --> 01:46:33,780
The three on the left are mine.

1148
01:46:34,680 --> 01:46:38,680
How can they be yours?
What are you talking about?

1149
01:46:38,680 --> 01:46:42,630
You carry two swords,
two of them are enough for you.

1150
01:46:42,630 --> 01:46:46,330
My scepter gets rusty
when it is not stained with blood.

1151
01:46:48,380 --> 01:46:50,790
This is not food Gurbuz Alp?
Why do you want more?

1152
01:46:50,790 --> 01:46:51,810
look at me.

1153
01:46:53,090 --> 01:46:55,290
Don't race with me, you can't win.

1154
01:46:55,290 --> 01:46:57,290
Why would I even race with you?

1155
01:46:57,390 --> 01:47:00,980
Are you my equivalent?
This is fight!

1156
01:47:03,130 --> 01:47:05,790
They're mine and this is over.

1157
01:47:06,370 --> 01:47:09,100
The field is for Gurbuz now.

1158
01:47:09,860 --> 01:47:11,860
Look at me, Gurbuz Alp!

1159
01:47:11,860 --> 01:47:15,150
When we get to the castle,
I'll tie you up and put you in a box!

1160
01:47:15,150 --> 01:47:18,170
You have neither food nor infidels!

1161
01:47:22,470 --> 01:47:23,970
Gurbuz!

1162
01:47:47,300 --> 01:47:49,050
Don't touch my infidel!

1163
01:48:06,330 --> 01:48:10,170
Come on, let's tell Malhun Hatun.

1164
01:48:10,430 --> 01:48:14,770
The path is clean for raiding.

1165
01:48:18,660 --> 01:48:20,420
Konya.

1166
01:48:24,805 --> 01:48:26,825
It's time to change shifts, let's go.

1167
01:48:32,215 --> 01:48:33,745
Break the door.

1168
01:48:59,545 --> 01:49:01,805
Now we know it is not a trap.

1169
01:49:02,065 --> 01:49:05,105
We will now pounce
like a wolf pounces on a flock

1170
01:49:05,105 --> 01:49:06,865
We'll take Sultan Mesut and get out.

1171
01:49:06,865 --> 01:49:08,415
Eyvallah my Bey.

1172
01:49:08,415 --> 01:49:10,415
- Inshallah my Bey.
- Let's go.

1173
01:49:29,445 --> 01:49:31,575
So this is the day.

1174
01:49:33,885 --> 01:49:38,055
I am ready for martyrdom, but...

1175
01:49:40,055 --> 01:49:43,565
I will not fall until I knock
most of you to the ground!

1176
01:51:39,685 --> 01:51:44,205
Sultan, come, come.

1177
01:51:44,825 --> 01:51:49,385
Come on, come on, you're fine, right?

1178
01:51:51,115 --> 01:51:57,705
Osman Bey, they will
consider you a traitor.

1179
01:51:57,705 --> 01:51:59,485
Because of this move you did.

1180
01:51:59,535 --> 01:52:02,545
No, I have never avoided that.

1181
01:52:02,585 --> 01:52:05,415
Didn't you also
make the same mistake before?

1182
01:52:11,575 --> 01:52:15,645
Hurry up, hurry up, hurry up.

1183
01:52:15,645 --> 01:52:17,485
They can't escape, my Bey.

1184
01:52:20,435 --> 01:52:22,215
Kill him wherever you see him.

1185
01:52:22,215 --> 01:52:23,555
As you command.

1186
01:52:26,485 --> 01:52:27,815
Hurry up.

1187
01:52:28,305 --> 01:52:30,885
There is still a lot of supplies
to be unloaded.

1188
01:52:38,545 --> 01:52:40,405
Increase the number of guards.

1189
01:52:40,505 --> 01:52:41,865
I did.

1190
01:52:42,905 --> 01:52:45,205
And I left the guys on the road.

1191
01:52:45,205 --> 01:52:47,205
We have information everywhere.

1192
01:52:47,205 --> 01:52:49,205
Keep your eyes open though, Frody.

1193
01:52:50,415 --> 01:52:52,285
Olof's orders are clear.

1194
01:52:53,335 --> 01:52:54,685
Good.

1195
01:53:03,465 --> 01:53:05,745
You two, go help.

1196
01:53:11,945 --> 01:53:14,145
Hurry up, come on, hurry up!

1197
01:53:17,585 --> 01:53:19,965
Attack, Alps!

1198
01:53:20,095 --> 01:53:21,855
Allah is eternal!

1199
01:53:22,345 --> 01:53:24,395
Attack!

1200
01:53:24,725 --> 01:53:26,805
Protect the supplies

1201
01:53:26,805 --> 01:53:28,805
Have no mercy on anyone!

1202
01:53:38,085 --> 01:53:40,225
Do you remember me, little boy?

1203
01:53:40,225 --> 01:53:43,265
I remember the dog I'm going to kill!

1204
01:54:24,095 --> 01:54:26,305
What are we waiting for, Turgut Bey?

1205
01:54:50,745 --> 01:54:54,525
They set a trap,
they come from everywhere!

1206
01:55:28,365 --> 01:55:30,265
You're on the wrong side, Turgut.

1207
01:55:30,265 --> 01:55:31,825
You should be on the other side!

1208
01:55:31,865 --> 01:55:34,105
I stand against everyone
who stands against the Turk

1209
01:55:34,235 --> 01:55:36,385
You are always on the side of your benefit.

1210
01:55:36,705 --> 01:55:38,065
Think however you like.

1211
01:56:09,065 --> 01:56:12,475
Burn the provisions... We will withdraw!

1212
01:56:38,615 --> 01:56:41,715
I will bury you in these lands, Turgut!

1213
01:56:41,755 --> 01:56:44,175
I will bury you, Turgut.

1214
01:56:55,155 --> 01:56:58,075
- Are you alright, son?
- I'm alright, Mother.

1215
01:57:00,925 --> 01:57:04,775
Gorbuz, load the supplies to the carriages.

1216
01:57:05,095 --> 01:57:06,635
We'll go back to Yenişehir.

1217
01:57:08,985 --> 01:57:11,545
Eyvallah Beys.

1218
01:57:13,165 --> 01:57:15,185
Eyvallah Beys.

1219
01:57:19,745 --> 01:57:21,505
Orhan Bey.

1220
01:57:24,265 --> 01:57:25,855
Cerkutay.

1221
01:57:30,755 --> 01:57:32,775
Thank you too, Turgut Bey.

1222
01:57:33,655 --> 01:57:37,655
But we didn't expect you with us,
rather we were expecting you against us.

1223
01:57:38,785 --> 01:57:40,785
I just saved your life.

1224
01:57:41,775 --> 01:57:44,045
Is this the first thing you say to me,
Malhun Hatun.

1225
01:57:44,515 --> 01:57:47,325
There is nothing you have saved,
Turgut Bey.

1226
01:57:48,285 --> 01:57:51,315
We have spoiled the game of the cruels
with our ability.

1227
01:57:51,845 --> 01:57:53,225
Eyvallah.

1228
01:57:55,035 --> 01:57:58,355
You should know that
you'll see me more often.

1229
01:57:59,035 --> 01:58:06,355
From now on, I will face those who raise
their swords to innocents in these lands.

1230
01:58:07,825 --> 01:58:09,885
Come on, let's go, Beys.

1231
01:58:13,965 --> 01:58:17,505
You turned your back on the
first obstacle, Turgut Bey.

1232
01:58:22,185 --> 01:58:25,735
You should know that the void you are
trying to fill is bigger than you

1233
01:58:26,835 --> 01:58:32,045
If you try to betray us again, there will
be only one thing for us to do.

1234
01:58:32,165 --> 01:58:33,945
Never forget this.

1235
01:58:36,295 --> 01:58:38,865
It seems that you have become
very fond of a threatening language.

1236
01:58:40,555 --> 01:58:43,145
No one is unreplaceable.

1237
01:58:44,915 --> 01:58:48,965
And when the case is one,
a leader is always easy to find.

1238
01:58:50,975 --> 01:58:52,675
Come on Beys.

1239
01:59:18,575 --> 01:59:20,855
Close everywhere!

1240
01:59:21,455 --> 01:59:22,775
Come on.

1241
01:59:57,450 --> 02:00:00,230
- Mesut is absent, sir.
- Get out of my way!

1242
02:00:05,140 --> 02:00:09,340
We have seen that when
the head is cut off, the body is useless.

1243
02:00:10,130 --> 02:00:14,240
Yenişehir has turned upside down
in the absence of Osman Bey.

1244
02:00:16,630 --> 02:00:21,380
It means no one is looking after
this entrustment properly, Bala Hatun.

1245
02:00:22,010 --> 02:00:27,460
The market was under our control
when Osman was here, Mother Sultan.

1246
02:00:27,900 --> 02:00:30,390
I heard it, I heard it.

1247
02:00:30,920 --> 02:00:35,850
I am not talking about you.
Malhun Hatun is responsible for the market.

1248
02:00:36,640 --> 02:00:40,370
But the market has turned upside down.

1249
02:00:41,140 --> 02:00:43,700
She doesn't care,
and she's not here, to say the least.

1250
02:00:43,790 --> 02:00:47,580
Malhun Hatun is doing the best she can.

1251
02:00:48,100 --> 02:00:52,950
- This issue...
- This issue is hugee, Bala Hatun.

1252
02:00:58,710 --> 02:01:01,780
You have dragged your people into poverty.

1253
02:01:02,670 --> 02:01:07,970
But don't worry, the Seljuk state
will always be by your side.

1254
02:01:14,070 --> 02:01:17,620
I will put my hand on the market
as Sultan Mother.

1255
02:01:17,750 --> 02:01:19,980
I will never allow that.

1256
02:01:30,830 --> 02:01:32,900
Hadrat Mother Sultan.

1257
02:01:33,230 --> 02:01:36,740
Oooo...
Malhun Hatun.

1258
02:01:37,730 --> 02:01:39,810
You have finally brought yourself.

1259
02:01:40,140 --> 02:01:44,350
But if you don't allow it now,
starvation will begin.

1260
02:01:48,850 --> 02:01:54,660
I will work to revive this
trade that you messed up.

1261
02:02:01,590 --> 02:02:03,180
The decision is up to you.

1262
02:02:04,170 --> 02:02:07,680
Make your decision
now in front of the people.

1263
02:02:09,370 --> 02:02:11,880
If you give me the responsibility
of running the market

1264
02:02:12,300 --> 02:02:18,300
I will bring all the caravans
tomorrow with a word from me.

1265
02:02:21,860 --> 02:02:24,960
And if you reject me...

1266
02:02:25,560 --> 02:02:29,340
You will drag your people into poverty.

1267
02:02:35,970 --> 02:02:37,670
And the decision is up to you.

1268
02:02:40,280 --> 02:02:41,790
Gurbuz Alp.

1269
02:03:06,620 --> 02:03:10,970
May Allah please you!

1270
02:03:14,740 --> 02:03:17,430
Allah bless you Malhun Hatun.

1271
02:03:17,550 --> 02:03:19,280
May Allah bless you, Malhun Hatun.

1272
02:03:21,890 --> 02:03:26,470
Look carefully, Mother Sultan, see it
with your own eyes.

1273
02:03:31,020 --> 02:03:35,110
Both the market and Yenisehir
are under our rule.

1274
02:03:36,300 --> 02:03:39,830
We have no authority to give to anyone!

1275
02:03:39,920 --> 02:03:42,550
Thank you Malhun Hatun!

1276
02:03:42,590 --> 02:03:44,320
May Allah keep us under you.

1277
02:03:44,380 --> 02:03:48,100
Alps! Distribute supplies to the people!

1278
02:03:53,460 --> 02:03:57,870
- Thank Allah!
- May Allah bless you!

1279
02:04:16,940 --> 02:04:20,020
Konya, Seljuk Palace

1280
02:04:46,860 --> 02:04:49,650
- Peace be upon you
- Peace be upon you too

1281
02:04:53,695 --> 02:04:57,725
His Majesty the Sultan awaits
Dursun Fakih and Aladdin.

1282
02:05:25,595 --> 02:05:27,295
Search everywhere.

1283
02:05:28,135 --> 02:05:30,635
Don't go back before you find him.

1284
02:05:44,165 --> 02:05:45,875
Osman.

1285
02:05:50,135 --> 02:05:55,555
I will strangle you with this rope!

1286
02:05:56,825 --> 02:06:02,265
And you did this even though you knew
I have your son!

1287
02:06:03,045 --> 02:06:05,195
Before you...

1288
02:06:06,675 --> 02:06:09,765
I will strangle him with this rope!

1289
02:06:20,105 --> 02:06:24,325
There is something I must do
before we leave Konya, Hadrat Sultan.

1290
02:06:24,635 --> 02:06:26,425
I have to solve it first.

1291
02:06:26,535 --> 02:06:30,275
What is more important than getting
out of Konya, Osman Bey?

1292
02:06:30,375 --> 02:06:31,955
My Sultan...

1293
02:06:32,425 --> 02:06:35,445
I gave them my son as a hostage
so I could get you out.

1294
02:06:36,035 --> 02:06:37,575
I will get him first.

1295
02:06:37,705 --> 02:06:39,575
This is the most important to me.

1296
02:06:42,005 --> 02:06:44,855
Eyvallah Osman Bey,
Eyvallah (thank you)

1297
02:06:45,195 --> 02:06:49,175
Don't worry.
My Alps will take you somewhere safe.

1298
02:06:50,155 --> 02:06:52,635
And I will come to you after I take my son.

1299
02:06:52,635 --> 02:06:56,105
Osman Bey, what are we going to do?

1300
02:06:57,225 --> 02:07:01,115
Don't worry,
you will take back your throne.

1301
02:07:02,425 --> 02:07:07,575
But first you must obtain the power
to be legitimate to sit on the throne.

1302
02:07:08,165 --> 02:07:11,685
For this reason,
no one should know where you are

1303
02:07:14,885 --> 02:07:16,755
Driver, stop.

1304
02:07:30,515 --> 02:07:32,565
Come on, we'll continue.

1305
02:07:43,275 --> 02:07:45,355
Stop, where are you going?

1306
02:07:50,485 --> 02:07:53,025
You two go, I'll work it out.

1307
02:08:16,275 --> 02:08:19,445
My son, Aladdin.

1308
02:08:36,855 --> 02:08:38,715
We are here, my Bey!

1309
02:08:39,415 --> 02:08:40,965
O Right!

1310
02:08:42,115 --> 02:08:43,905
O Right!

1311
02:08:44,465 --> 02:08:46,045
O Right!

1312
02:08:46,125 --> 02:08:47,645
O Right!

1313
02:08:48,215 --> 02:08:49,795
O Allah!

1314
02:08:51,145 --> 02:08:52,705
O Right!

1315
02:08:57,765 --> 02:08:59,355
O Right!

1316
02:08:59,675 --> 02:09:01,225
O Right!

1317
02:09:18,905 --> 02:09:20,225
Son.

1318
02:09:27,445 --> 02:09:28,745
Son.

1319
02:09:33,145 --> 02:09:34,915
- Father.
- Son.

1320
02:09:35,625 --> 02:09:37,685
I would never leave you with them!

1321
02:09:38,965 --> 02:09:41,515
Your father never leaves you alone, son.

1322
02:09:59,795 --> 02:10:01,375
Thank you.

1323
02:10:02,265 --> 02:10:03,855
Thank you.

1324
02:10:18,105 --> 02:10:19,435
Open!

1325
02:10:32,495 --> 02:10:36,345
Did the Sultan
understand his mistake, Vizier?

1326
02:10:36,675 --> 02:10:38,505
Osman took Mesut.

1327
02:10:39,935 --> 02:10:45,205
If you had convinced that stupid kid then,
I wouldn't have allowed it, Vizier!

1328
02:10:46,045 --> 02:10:48,935
You just watched it while
I was being sent to the prison!

1329
02:10:50,175 --> 02:10:54,745
Ghazan Khan's anger will burn all of Konya!

1330
02:11:00,625 --> 02:11:03,625
Before the Khan burns Konya...

1331
02:11:04,605 --> 02:11:07,215
He will hold us accountable for our failure.

1332
02:11:08,495 --> 02:11:12,685
Now, you will go and find them, Samagar.

1333
02:11:13,565 --> 02:11:16,675
You will kill Mesut and Osman.

1334
02:11:17,485 --> 02:11:20,175
- Does Mother Sultan know anything?
- Not at all.

1335
02:11:21,555 --> 02:11:24,735
I sent a messenger.
She'll know soon.

1336
02:11:25,395 --> 02:11:27,825
Don't worry about it now.

1337
02:11:28,065 --> 02:11:31,965
Rather, think about
how you will kill Osman and Mesut.

1338
02:11:32,385 --> 02:11:36,675
I swear on the Sky God,
I will kill them both!

1339
02:11:38,930 --> 02:11:42,010
Famous Mongolian Commander Saveli.

1340
02:11:46,690 --> 02:11:51,010
We have to work this out without
Ghazan Khan finding out.

1341
02:11:51,360 --> 02:11:55,400
Otherwise, Konya can't survive.

1342
02:11:55,950 --> 02:12:00,530
He will not leave a stone upon a stone,
nor a head over a shoulder.

1343
02:12:08,590 --> 02:12:10,100
Untie him.

1344
02:12:39,498 --> 02:13:08,928
Please contact turkision@gmail.com for any inquiries